  "b0c4bdllfk": {"title":"Makimoo Outdoor And Indoor Square Seat Cushions 2 Pack With Ties Soft Padded Chair Pads For Dining Kitchen Patio Garden Chairs 43 x 43 cm (Orange Red Striped)","bullets":"Thick Padded Comfort: Generous filling creates a cushioned layer between you and hard chair surfaces, making every seat feel more inviting.\n\nSecure Tie Straps: Corner loops let you fasten each cushion to a chair back or frame, helping keep the pad in place as you sit and stand.\n\nCheerful Striped Pattern: The warm mix of orange, red, brown, and neutral stripes adds a bright, welcoming touch to dining rooms, kitchens, patios, and gardens.\n\nVersatile 2-Pack: Includes two square chair pads measuring 43 x 43cm, ideal for standard dining chairs, bistro seats, patio furniture, and more.\n\nLong-Lasting Shape: Tufted stitching helps the filling stay evenly distributed, so the cushions retain their shape through regular use.","sku":"US-F61ZXX","images":["/images/products/B0C4BDLLFK/1.webp","/images/products/B0C4BDLLFK/2.webp","/images/products/B0C4BDLLFK/3.webp","/images/products/B0C4BDLLFK/4.webp","/images/products/B0C4BDLLFK/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,true,false,false]},
  "b0f62y59cw": {"title":"Makimoo Pillow Inserts 50 x 70 cm Set of 2 Soft Fluffy Hollow Fiber Cushion Fillings for Sofa Bed Couch Decorative Pillow Inserts with Plush Support for Bedroom Living Room (White)","bullets":"Soft and Fluffy Hollow Fiber Fill: Filled with lightweight, resilient hollow fiber, these 50 x 70cm pillow inserts offer a plush, cloud-like feel that adds inviting comfort to decorative cushions on sofas, beds, and couches.\n\nBreathable Fabric for Lasting Comfort: Each cushion insert is wrapped in a soft, breathable cover that promotes airflow, helping the pillows stay fresh and comfortable through everyday use.\n\nResilient Shape Retention: The carefully lofted fiber filling bounces back after compression, helping the inserts maintain a full, supportive shape so your cushion covers look tidy and welcoming.\n\nEasy Machine Care: Designed for convenient cleaning, these pillow inserts are machine washable, allowing you to keep your living room, bedroom, or guest space clean with minimal effort.\n\nVersatile 2-Pack for Any Space: This set includes two white 50 x 70cm cushion inserts that fit standard pillow covers and work beautifully on sofas, beds, armchairs, car seats, and window seats.","sku":"DE-FZPMRB","images":["/images/products/B0F62Y59CW/1.webp","/images/products/B0F62Y59CW/2.webp","/images/products/B0F62Y59CW/3.webp","/images/products/B0F62Y59CW/4.webp","/images/products/B0F62Y59CW/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true]},
  "b0gd81wt1b": {"title":"Indoor Outdoor Square Tufted Seat Cushions Set of 2 with Ties Patio Chair Pads Thick Padded Floral Dining Kitchen Garden Furniture Cushion 43 x 43 cm (Teal Blue Floral)","bullets":"Plush Tufted Comfort: Thick, resilient filling and a classic tufted design provide a soft, supportive seat for dining, lounging, or entertaining on the patio.\n\nBright Floral Style: A teal base with orange, coral, and cream blossoms brings a fresh, garden-ready look to kitchens, dining rooms, balconies, and porches.\n\nStay-in-Place Ties: Two attached fabric ties loop around chair backs or frames to help keep the cushion from sliding while you sit.\n\nIndoor and Outdoor Versatility: The durable cover makes these cushions a practical choice for everyday seating inside or in covered outdoor areas.\n\nConvenient Two-Pack: Each set includes two 43 x 43cm square chair pads, making it easy to refresh a pair of dining chairs or patio seats with coordinated comfort.","sku":"US-21J9B7","images":["/images/products/B0GD81WT1B/1.webp","/images/products/B0GD81WT1B/2.webp","/images/products/B0GD81WT1B/3.webp","/images/products/B0GD81WT1B/4.webp","/images/products/B0GD81WT1B/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,true,true,true]},
  "b0gd84d8vc": {"title":"Set of 2 Tufted Outdoor Chair Cushions With Ties, Square Patio Seat Pads for Garden Dining Kitchen Chairs, Soft Supportive Fiber Filled Indoor Outdoor Pads 43 x 43 cm (Green Lantern)","bullets":"Set of 2 Tufted Seat Cushions: Each cushion measures 43 x 43cm and features a classic tufted construction with a decorative green lantern pattern, adding comfort and style to dining chairs, patio sets, and kitchen seating.\n\nSecure Corner Ties: Attached fabric ties on each cushion help keep the pad firmly in place on chairs, preventing slipping or shifting during everyday meals, work sessions, and outdoor gatherings.\n\nPlush Fiber Fill: Filled with soft polyester fiber for a supportive yet comfortable seat, these cushions help reduce pressure while you sit and relax on metal, wood, wicker, or resin chairs.\n\nVersatile Indoor and Outdoor Use: The square shape and fresh print work beautifully on patios, balconies, decks, and in dining rooms, making these pads a practical choice for multiple living spaces.\n\nEasy to Coordinate: The green lantern print brings a fresh decorative accent that complements a variety of furniture finishes and seasonal decor themes.","sku":"US-IMBGO8","images":["/images/products/B0GD84D8VC/1.webp","/images/products/B0GD84D8VC/2.webp","/images/products/B0GD84D8VC/3.webp","/images/products/B0GD84D8VC/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,true,true]},
  "b0grj9sdtf": {"title":"Premium Rectangular Pillow Inserts Set Of 2 For Sofa Bed Couch Decorative Cushion Fillings Soft Fluffy Hollow Fiber Filling Supportive Breathable Home Decor 40 x 80 cm (White)","bullets":"Plush Hollow Fiber Fill: Each insert is generously filled with airy hollow fiber for a soft, cloud-like feel that holds its shape while offering gentle support for lounging, sleeping, or decorative styling.\n\nPerfect 40 x 80cm Size: The rectangular shape fits standard cushion covers and pillowcases, making these inserts a practical choice for sofas, beds, couches, armchairs, cars, and window seats.\n\nBreathable And Comfortable: The lightweight fiber construction allows heat and moisture to escape, helping you stay cool and relaxed whether you are napping, reading, or watching television.\n\nDurable, Resilient Construction: Tightly stitched seams and evenly distributed filling resist clumping and sagging; simply fluff the inserts regularly to restore loft and maintain a neat, tailored look.\n\nVersatile Two-Pack Value: Receive two matching pillow inserts ready to refresh your living room, bedroom, guest room, or any cozy corner with clean, inviting comfort.","sku":"DE-Z7P36N","images":["/images/products/B0GRJ9SDTF/1.webp","/images/products/B0GRJ9SDTF/2.webp","/images/products/B0GRJ9SDTF/3.webp","/images/products/B0GRJ9SDTF/4.webp","/images/products/B0GRJ9SDTF/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true]},
  "b0h4v662hl": {"title":"Premium Pillow Inserts 45 x 45 cm Set of 2 Decorative Square Cushion Fillers Soft Fluffy Polyester Throw Pillows for Sofa Bed Couch Chair Bedroom Living Room Home Decor (White)","bullets":"Fits Standard Covers: Each insert measures 45 x 45 cm and is designed to fit square cushion covers and decorative pillowcases, giving your living space a neat and polished look.\n\nSoft and Fluffy Filling: Made with premium polyester fiberfill that stays plump and supportive, these inserts provide cloud-like comfort for lounging, napping, or adding extra back support.\n\nReinforced Double-Stitched Seams: Expertly crafted with reinforced edges to help prevent tearing and fiber leakage, ensuring long-lasting shape retention through everyday use.\n\nTwo-Pack Set: Includes two high-quality pillow inserts in one set, ideal for refreshing multiple rooms, seasonal decor swaps, or coordinating cushions across your home.\n\nVersatile Home Decor Accent: Suitable for sofas, beds, couches, chairs, bedrooms, and living rooms, these white cushion fillers complement any interior style with clean, classic appeal.","sku":"DE-6PYYD5","images":["/images/products/B0H4V662HL/1.webp","/images/products/B0H4V662HL/2.webp","/images/products/B0H4V662HL/3.webp","/images/products/B0H4V662HL/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false]},
  "b0cjhx7xkl": {"title":"Makimoo Classic Houndstooth Decorative Chair Cushions Set of 2 Thick Soft Tufted Square Seat Pads with Ties for Dining Kitchen Patio Indoor Outdoor Use 43 x 43 cm (Navy Blue)","bullets":"Plush Seating Comfort: Each cushion is generously filled and tufted to provide a soft, supportive layer that helps reduce pressure during long meals, work sessions, or relaxed conversations.\n\nTimeless Houndstooth Pattern: The navy blue and off-white checkered design adds a classic, refined touch to dining chairs, kitchen seating, patio sets, and office chairs.\n\nSecure Tie-On Design: Two matching fabric ties let you fasten each cushion firmly to chair backs or seats, helping prevent shifting and sliding as you sit or stand.\n\nVersatile Indoor and Outdoor Use: Sized at 43 x 43cm, these square pads fit a variety of standard chairs in the dining room, living room, garden, balcony, or porch.\n\nConvenient Two-Pack Value: Sold as a set of two matching cushions, making it simple to coordinate seating in breakfast nooks, guest rooms, cafés, and event spaces.","sku":"US-0Q1C0P","images":["/images/products/B0CJHX7XKL/1.webp","/images/products/B0CJHX7XKL/2.webp","/images/products/B0CJHX7XKL/3.webp","/images/products/B0CJHX7XKL/4.webp","/images/products/B0CJHX7XKL/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true]},
  "b0cjhl4lzp": {"title":"Makimoo Chair Cushions Set of 2 Oil Painting Floral Seat Pads with Ties Thick Tufted Soft Square Kitchen Dining Room Bedroom Home Office Chair Pads 43 x 43 cm (Multicolor)","bullets":"Artistic Oil Painting Design: Inspired by impressionist floral artwork, the vibrant print adds a painterly touch to dining chairs, kitchen seating, and office chairs.\n\nThick Tufted Comfort: Plush padded construction offers a soft, supportive seat that helps reduce pressure during long meals or work sessions.\n\nStay-in-Place Ties: Each cushion includes two matching fabric ties to secure the pad to chair rungs and keep it from sliding out of place.\n\nIdeal 43 x 43cm Size: The square shape provides generous coverage for a variety of standard chairs, stools, and accent seating.\n\nSet of 2 for Coordinated Style: Includes two matching seat pads that create a unified look across your dining room, breakfast nook, or workspace.","sku":"US-UR63MB","images":["/images/products/B0CJHL4LZP/1.webp","/images/products/B0CJHL4LZP/2.webp","/images/products/B0CJHL4LZP/3.webp","/images/products/B0CJHL4LZP/4.webp","/images/products/B0CJHL4LZP/5.webp","/images/products/B0CJHL4LZP/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,true]},
  "b0c8j292wf": {"title":"Makimoo Travel Neck Pillow 360 Degree Head and Neck Support Memory Foam U Shaped Pillow with Adjustable Snap Button and Carry Bag for Airplane Car Train Bus Home Sleeping (Pink)","bullets":"360-Degree Support for Restful Sleep: The curved U-shaped design cradles your head, neck, and chin in natural alignment, helping reduce stiffness and muscle fatigue on long flights, road trips, train rides, or daily commutes. Raised side supports help keep your head from tilting or falling forward so you can relax more fully.\n\nResponsive Memory Foam Comfort: Filled with slow-rebound memory foam that gently molds to your unique contours and evenly distributes pressure, then springs back to shape after each use. The plush, skin-friendly cover adds a soft touch for comfortable rest in any season.\n\nAdjustable Snap-Button Fit: Features a secure dual-snap closure that lets you customize the fit around your neck and keep the pillow in place while seated upright. The snaps also make it easy to fasten the pillow to a bag or suitcase strap for hands-free carrying.\n\nPortable Travel Set with Carry Bag: Includes a lightweight drawstring storage bag that keeps the pillow clean and compact when not in use. Slip it into your carry-on, backpack, or car seat pocket for cushioned support wherever you go.\n\nVersatile Companion for Any Journey: Ideal for airplanes, cars, trains, buses, recliners, office chairs, and home use. The soft pink finish and clean look make it a thoughtful choice for frequent travelers, students, and anyone who values comfort on the move.","sku":"US-7EPNJD","images":["/images/products/B0C8J292WF/1.webp","/images/products/B0C8J292WF/2.webp","/images/products/B0C8J292WF/3.webp","/images/products/B0C8J292WF/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true,false,true]},
  "b0c8j237v3": {"title":"Makimoo U Shaped Memory Foam Travel Neck Pillow with 360 Degree Support, Adjustable Snap Closure, Soft Velvet Cover and Carry Bag for Airplane Car Train Bus Home (Navy Blue)","bullets":"360 Degree Neck Support: Ergonomic U shaped design cradles your head, neck and chin to help reduce strain during long flights, car rides, train trips and bus commutes.\n\nAdjustable Snap Closure: The side snap strap lets you customize the fit and keeps the pillow comfortably and securely in place while you rest.\n\nResponsive Memory Foam Fill: Quality memory foam gently molds to your natural contours and springs back after use, providing consistent cushioning trip after trip.\n\nSoft Velvet Cover: Plush velour fabric feels gentle against skin and allows airflow to help keep you comfortable in varying temperatures.\n\nPortable with Carry Bag: Lightweight construction rolls neatly into the included drawstring storage bag for easy packing in a carry-on, backpack or luggage.","sku":"US-347R1H","images":["/images/products/B0C8J237V3/1.webp","/images/products/B0C8J237V3/2.webp","/images/products/B0C8J237V3/3.webp","/images/products/B0C8J237V3/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true,false,true]},
  "b0c69rryxm": {"title":"Inflatable Travel Neck Pillow With Eye Mask Earplugs Set Soft Velvet Hump Design Adjustable Firmness Washable Cover For Airplane Car Train Bus Office And Home Naps (Pink)","bullets":"Ergonomic Hump Support: The raised hump design cradles your head and neck from both sides, helping reduce stiffness and encouraging a more relaxed resting position during long trips.\n\nSoft Velvety Touch: A plush velvet-style cover feels gentle against skin, while the breathable material helps keep you comfortable through extended flights, road trips, or office naps.\n\nAdjustable Inflation Level: Easily add or release air through the secure leak-resistant valve to find your ideal firmness, whether you prefer soft cushioning or more structured support.\n\nComplete Travel Kit Included: The set comes with a pair of foam earplugs and a contoured eye mask, so you can block out light and noise for a calmer, more restful sleep on the go.\n\nConvenient And Easy To Clean: The lightweight, compact pillow quickly deflates for packing, and the removable cover can be washed to keep your travel accessory fresh trip after trip.","sku":"US-POO48O","images":["/images/products/B0C69RRYXM/1.webp","/images/products/B0C69RRYXM/2.webp","/images/products/B0C69RRYXM/3.webp","/images/products/B0C69RRYXM/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,true,true,false]},
  "b0c69rr6gf": {"title":"Makimoo Inflatable Travel Neck Pillow with Hump Support Soft Velvet U Shaped Air Pillow Includes Eye Mask and Earplugs for Airplane Car Train Office Rest (Navy Blue)","bullets":"Ergonomic Hump Design: Raised side support cradles the neck and chin to help maintain comfortable alignment while resting in a seated position.\n\nPlush Velvet Cover: Soft, skin-friendly velvet fabric creates a cozy surface for long flights, road trips, or office naps.\n\nAdjustable Inflation: Easy-to-use air valve allows personalized firmness control and quick deflation for compact packing in luggage or carry-ons.\n\nComplete Travel Set: Comes with a sleep mask and foam earplugs to reduce light and ambient noise during rest.\n\nVersatile Travel Companion: Suitable for airplanes, trains, cars, buses, and home or office use, offering lightweight neck support wherever you go.","sku":"US-RQUCV0","images":["/images/products/B0C69RR6GF/1.webp","/images/products/B0C69RR6GF/2.webp","/images/products/B0C69RR6GF/3.webp","/images/products/B0C69RR6GF/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,true,true,false]},
  "b0c69rjvvt": {"title":"Makimoo Inflatable Neck Pillow Ergonomic Hump Design Soft Velvet Cover Adjustable Firmness Travel Pillow with Eye Mask and Earplugs for Airplane Car Train Home Office (Black)","bullets":"Ergonomic Hump Support: The raised hump design cradles the neck and helps keep the head from falling forward, offering stable support for resting during long flights, road trips, or office breaks.\n\nSoft Velvet-Like Surface: Covered in a smooth, plush fabric that feels gentle against the skin, this pillow helps reduce friction and irritation while you relax or sleep upright.\n\nAdjustable Inflation Valve: A secure air valve lets you easily add or release air to reach your preferred level of firmness, and the pillow quickly deflates for compact storage in a bag.\n\nComplete Travel Rest Kit: This set includes a matching eye mask and a pair of foam earplugs to help block light and dull surrounding noise for a more peaceful travel experience.\n\nLightweight and Portable: Weighing little and packing flat when deflated, the pillow is easy to carry on planes, trains, buses, and cars, making it a practical companion for daily commutes and vacations.","sku":"US-ZZZAEI","images":["/images/products/B0C69RJVVT/1.webp","/images/products/B0C69RJVVT/2.webp","/images/products/B0C69RJVVT/3.webp","/images/products/B0C69RJVVT/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,true,true,false]},
  "b0c69qnsb3": {"title":"Inflatable Travel Neck Pillow with Ergonomic Hump Support Soft Velvet U Shaped Air Pillow for Airplane Car Train Office Napping Includes Eye Mask and Earplugs Compact (Grey)","bullets":"Ergonomic Hump Design for Reliable Neck Support: The raised side cushions help cradle your head and neck, letting you rest more comfortably on planes, in cars, on trains, or at your desk.\n\nSoft Velvet Surface for Cozy Comfort: The plush velvet-touch fabric feels gentle against skin and provides a smooth resting surface for long flights, road trips, or midday breaks.\n\nQuick Inflation and Deflation Valve: A simple air valve lets you add or release air in seconds, so you can easily adjust the firmness to match your preferred sleeping position.\n\nEye Mask and Earplugs Included: This travel set comes with a lightweight sleep mask and a pair of foam earplugs to help reduce light and ambient noise while you rest.\n\nLightweight and Packable for Any Trip: The pillow deflates quickly and folds down small, making it easy to slip into carry-ons, backpacks, or tote bags without adding extra bulk.","sku":"US-Y1L7JZ","images":["/images/products/B0C69QNSB3/1.webp","/images/products/B0C69QNSB3/2.webp","/images/products/B0C69QNSB3/3.webp","/images/products/B0C69QNSB3/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,true,true,false]},
  "b0c4b9t6jv": {"title":"Makimoo Chair Cushions Set Of 2 Thick Soft Tufted Square Seat Pads With Ties For Dining Kitchen Patio Garden Chairs Indoor Outdoor Home Use 43 x 43 cm (Green Plaid)","bullets":"Set Of 2 Chair Cushions: Add comfort to dining chairs, kitchen chairs, patio chairs, or garden seating with this matching pair of tufted seat pads featuring a classic green plaid pattern.\n\nGenerous 43 x 43cm Size: Each square cushion offers ample seating coverage, helping you relax during meals, work, or outdoor gatherings without feeling cramped.\n\nSecure Tie-On Design: Built-in fabric ties attach easily to chair backs or frames, keeping the cushions steady and neatly in place during daily use.\n\nPlush Tufted Construction: Thick padded filling and button-tufted detailing create a supportive, cushioned feel that invites you to sit longer in comfort.\n\nVersatile Indoor And Outdoor Style: The woven-look green plaid fabric complements a variety of decor settings, from dining rooms and kitchens to patios and balconies.","sku":"US-FHJRDS","images":["/images/products/B0C4B9T6JV/1.webp","/images/products/B0C4B9T6JV/2.webp","/images/products/B0C4B9T6JV/3.webp","/images/products/B0C4B9T6JV/4.webp","/images/products/B0C4B9T6JV/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,true,true]},
  "b0gjlvmht7": {"title":"Textured Geometric Embossed Pillowcases Set of 2 Soft Brushed Microfiber Easy Care Pillow Covers for Kids Bedroom Decorative Travel Cushion Sham 30 x 50 cm (Pink)","bullets":"Elegant Textured Finish: Subtle geometric embossing adds a refined, hotel-style touch to beds, sofas, and travel pillows while remaining gentle against the skin.\n\nCozy Brushed Microfiber: Woven from finely brushed microfiber for a smooth, breathable feel that helps create a comfortable resting environment night after night.\n\nPerfectly Sized 2-Pack: Each set includes two 30 x 50cm pillow covers designed to fit small standard pillows, childrens pillows, and decorative cushion inserts.\n\nVersatile Styling Options: The soft blush pink tone and understated pattern complement nursery, bedroom, dorm, and living room decor with ease.\n\nEasy Everyday Care: Machine washable fabric holds its shape and color through repeated washing for long-lasting freshness and convenience.","sku":"UK-X2V4LC","images":["/images/products/B0GJLVMHT7/1.webp","/images/products/B0GJLVMHT7/2.webp","/images/products/B0GJLVMHT7/3.webp","/images/products/B0GJLVMHT7/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false]},
  "b0gjlsdz52": {"title":"Makimoo Embossed Cushion Covers Set of 2 Soft Microfibre Pillowcases with Envelope Closure Breathable Lightweight for Bed Sofa Bedroom Living Room 40 x 80 cm (Light Grey)","bullets":"Luxuriously Soft Microfibre: Crafted from 100% microfibre, these cushion covers offer a silky-smooth feel against the skin and create a cozy surface for sleeping, lounging, and relaxing.\n\nElegant Embossed Texture: The subtle woven-style embossing adds a refined decorative touch that complements bedding, sofas, chairs, and living spaces with a calm, modern look.\n\nSecure Envelope Closure: Each cover features a hidden envelope opening that keeps the insert neatly tucked inside while allowing quick and effortless insertion and removal.\n\nEasy Care & Long-Lasting: Machine washable, tumble dry friendly, and quick to dry, the fabric retains its shape and soft texture through regular use and repeated washing.\n\nPerfect Fit for 40 x 80cm Cushions: Tailored to fit standard 40 x 80cm pillows snugly, this two-pack set provides versatile styling options for bedrooms, guest rooms, and lounges.","sku":"UK-IEZSLW","images":["/images/products/B0GJLSDZ52/1.webp","/images/products/B0GJLSDZ52/2.webp","/images/products/B0GJLSDZ52/3.webp","/images/products/B0GJLSDZ52/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false]},
  "b0gjlp59k1": {"title":"Makimoo Embossed Microfiber Pillow Covers 50 x 70 cm Set Of 2 Soft Breathable Skin Friendly Durable Envelope Closure Cushion Covers For Bedroom Sofa Living Room (White)","bullets":"Luxuriously Soft Microfiber: These cushion covers are made entirely from high-quality microfiber with an embossed texture, creating a gentle, cloud-like surface that feels cozy against the skin.\n\nPerfect Fit with Envelope Closure: Each cover measures 50 x 70cm and features a neat envelope closure that keeps your pillow insert securely tucked inside while making removal quick and easy.\n\nEasy Care and Long-Lasting Color: Machine washable and tumble dry friendly, these covers are designed to maintain their bright white shade and smooth shape through repeated washes without needing ironing.\n\nDurable, Well-Made Construction: Neatly stitched seams and quality microfiber help resist loose threads and everyday wear, making these covers a reliable choice for daily use on beds and sofas.\n\nVersatile Style for Any Space: The clean white embossed finish complements bedroom, guest room, or living room decor, adding a fresh and inviting touch to your pillows.","sku":"UK-OAXNUD","images":["/images/products/B0GJLP59K1/1.webp","/images/products/B0GJLP59K1/2.webp","/images/products/B0GJLP59K1/3.webp","/images/products/B0GJLP59K1/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,true,false]},
  "b0gjlnmx2g": {"title":"Makimoo Embossed Pillowcases Set of 2 Ultra Soft Breathable 100% Microfiber Decorative Cushion Covers with Hidden Envelope Closure for Bed Sofa 40 x 70 cm (Light Grey)","bullets":"Luxuriously Soft Microfibre: Crafted from 100% microfibre, these 40 x 70cm cushion covers feel exceptionally smooth and gentle against skin, offering a cloud-like touch for restful sleep and relaxation.\n\nElegant Textured Pattern: The subtle embossed weave adds a refined, decorative finish that complements modern bedrooms, living rooms, and guest rooms while enhancing the overall look of your bedding.\n\nConvenient Envelope Closure: Each cover features a neat envelope closure that keeps pillows securely tucked inside, prevents slipping, and creates a clean, seamless appearance on both sides.\n\nDurable and Easy to Maintain: The tightly woven microfibre resists fading, pilling, and shrinking. Simply machine wash, tumble dry, and enjoy non-iron convenience for everyday use.\n\nVersatile Two-Pack Set: Includes two standard-size pillow covers in a versatile light grey shade, perfect for refreshing your bed, sofa, couch, or armchair with coordinated comfort and style.","sku":"UK-05RCY9","images":["/images/products/B0GJLNMX2G/1.webp","/images/products/B0GJLNMX2G/2.webp","/images/products/B0GJLNMX2G/3.webp","/images/products/B0GJLNMX2G/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,true,false]},
  "b0gjlp4pr2": {"title":"Makimoo Embossed Microfiber Pillowcases Set of 2 Soft Durable Rectangular Cushion Covers with Envelope Closure Breathable All Season Skin Friendly Pillow Cases 40 x 70 cm (Pink)","bullets":"Luxuriously Soft Microfiber: Crafted from finely brushed microfiber, these pillowcases offer a silky smooth, cloud-like touch. The elegant embossed pattern adds subtle texture and a refined finish to your bedding or living space.\n\nEnvelope Closure for a Secure Fit: Each cover features a neat envelope closure that keeps pillows tucked in place while maintaining a clean, seamless look on both sides. No zippers means no snagging on fabric or hair.\n\nBreathable and Skin Friendly: Lightweight microfiber allows air to pass through easily, helping you stay comfortable in any season. The gentle surface feels soft against sensitive skin for a more restful sleep.\n\nEasy Care and Long Lasting Quality: Machine washable and tumble dry friendly, these covers resist fading, shrinking and wrinkling. They retain their shape and soft feel wash after wash, saving you time on ironing.\n\nSet of Two Versatile Covers: This package includes two coordinating pink cushion covers sized 40 x 70cm, ideal for refreshing pillows in the bedroom, guest room, living room sofa or travel setup.","sku":"UK-YRGB77","images":["/images/products/B0GJLP4PR2/1.webp","/images/products/B0GJLP4PR2/2.webp","/images/products/B0GJLP4PR2/3.webp","/images/products/B0GJLP4PR2/4.webp","/images/products/B0GJLP4PR2/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,true,false]},
  "b0gjlmc6z4": {"title":"Makimoo Embossed Pillowcases 2 Pack Soft Textured Pillow Covers with Elegant Geometric Pattern for Bed Couch Sofa Decorative Throw Pillowcases 30 x 50 cm (White)","bullets":"Elegant Embossed Texture: Each pillowcase features a refined geometric embossed pattern that adds subtle depth and a hotel-inspired look to your bedroom, living room, or guest space without overwhelming your existing decor.\n\nPerfectly Sized 2-Pack: Designed to fit 30 x 50cm pillows, this set includes two matching pillowcases, making it easy to refresh your bed, sofa, or decorative cushion arrangement.\n\nSoft and Breathable Fabric: Crafted from lightweight, breathable material that feels gentle against the skin and helps promote a comfortable sleeping environment throughout the year.\n\nCrisp White Versatility: The clean white tone complements a wide range of bedding styles and color schemes, offering a fresh, timeless backdrop for both modern and classic interiors.\n\nEasy Care and Durable Construction: Machine washable for everyday convenience; the embossed texture retains its shape and the fabric stays smooth wash after wash.","sku":"UK-TZ84Y4","images":["/images/products/B0GJLMC6Z4/1.webp","/images/products/B0GJLMC6Z4/2.webp","/images/products/B0GJLMC6Z4/3.webp","/images/products/B0GJLMC6Z4/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,true]},
  "b0gjlgxtl4": {"title":"Makimoo Embossed Microfibre Pillowcases 40 x 80 cm Set of 2 with Envelope Closure Soft Durable Skin Friendly Breathable Lightweight Bed Pillow Covers for Bedroom Sofa (Pink)","bullets":"SUPER SOFT & SKIN-FRIENDLY: Made from 100% microfibre, these 40 x 80cm pillowcases feel smooth and gentle against skin, creating a cosy surface for relaxing sleep every night.\n\nELEGANT EMBOSSED TEXTURE: The refined embossed finish adds subtle depth and style, making these covers a versatile match for bedroom, guest room or living room decor.\n\nENVELOPE CLOSURE FOR EASY USE: A practical envelope closure tucks your pillow neatly inside without exposed zippers or buttons, keeping the cover secure and giving your bed or sofa a clean, tidy look.\n\nEASY CARE & LONG-LASTING: Machine washable, tumble dry and no ironing required, these covers keep their shape and colour through regular washing, saving time on everyday upkeep.\n\nWELL-MADE SET OF 2: Each pack includes two 40 x 80cm cushion covers with neatly processed seams, offering a reliable fit and a durable addition to your bedding collection.","sku":"UK-YL8J1L","images":["/images/products/B0GJLGXTL4/1.webp","/images/products/B0GJLGXTL4/2.webp","/images/products/B0GJLGXTL4/3.webp","/images/products/B0GJLGXTL4/4.webp","/images/products/B0GJLGXTL4/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true]},
  "b0gjlgm6xg": {"title":"Set of 2 Pillowcases 40 x 80 cm, Soft Durable & Skin-friendly, 100% Microfiber Pillowcases (White)","bullets":" Very soft and pleasant: Heavenly soft microfiber for a sleep like on clouds. The breathable material prevents sweating and significantly increases your sleeping comfort.  \n Available in several colors and sizes: With numerous colors and sizes, the covers fit perfectly into any room concept and provide stylish accents.  \n Easy care: Tumble dryer safe and no ironing required: The covers are easy to care for, retain their shape and dry particularly quickly.  \n Well processed: Neatly processed seams without loose threads ensure a perfect fit. Our customer service is always happy to help you with any questions.  \n Timeless colors: Suitable for any furnishing style. Available in many elegant solid colors – ideal for bedrooms, guest rooms and living rooms. As a pillowcase on the sofa, it becomes a real eye-catcher.  ","sku":"UK-0TKYCM","images":["/images/products/B0GJLGM6XG/1.webp","/images/products/B0GJLGM6XG/2.webp","/images/products/B0GJLGM6XG/3.webp","/images/products/B0GJLGM6XG/4.webp","/images/products/B0GJLGM6XG/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true]},
  "b0gjldwt6x": {"title":"Makimoo Embossed Pillow Cases Set of 2 Luxury Soft Brushed Microfiber Pillowcases with Hidden Envelope Closure Wrinkle and Fade Resistant Easy Care Breathable 30 x 50 cm (Grey)","bullets":"Elegant Embossed Texture: Each pillowcase features a refined geometric embossed pattern that adds subtle texture and visual interest to your bedding for a polished, finished look.\n\nPremium Brushed Microfiber: Crafted from soft brushed microfiber fabric that feels gentle against skin while offering durable performance for daily use.\n\nHidden Envelope Closure: Designed with a concealed envelope closure that keeps your pillow neatly tucked inside and prevents it from slipping out during the night.\n\nEasy Care Fabric: Wrinkle and fade resistant material holds its shape and color through regular washing, saving time on ironing and maintenance.\n\nTailored 30 x 50cm Fit: This two-piece set is designed to fit 30 x 50cm pillows with a smooth, secure fit, making it ideal for guest rooms, travel pillows, or decorative accent pillows.","sku":"UK-1EWODX","images":["/images/products/B0GJLDWT6X/1.webp","/images/products/B0GJLDWT6X/2.webp","/images/products/B0GJLDWT6X/3.webp","/images/products/B0GJLDWT6X/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false]},
  "b0gjldmt57": {"title":"Makimoo Embossed Cushion Covers Set of 2 Soft Breathable 100 Percent Microfiber Pillow Cases with Envelope Closure for Sofa Bedroom Living Room Decor 50 x 70 cm (Light Grey)","bullets":"Soft and Skin Friendly Fabric: Made from 100 percent microfiber, these cushion covers offer a smooth, gentle feel against the skin. The embossed surface adds subtle texture and a refined look while staying breathable for everyday comfort.\n\nEnvelope Closure for a Clean Look: Each cover features a hidden envelope closure that keeps the insert securely tucked inside and makes changing or removing fillings quick and easy, with no exposed zippers to snag or scratch.\n\nTwo Covers in a Versatile Size: The set includes two cushion covers measuring 50 x 70cm, fitting standard pillows and shams on sofas, beds, armchairs and lounge seating to refresh your space in minutes.\n\nEasy Care and Lasting Color: Machine washable and tumble dry friendly, these covers keep their shape, dry quickly and require no ironing. The light grey color resists fading for a neat appearance wash after wash.\n\nSimple Style for Any Room: The neutral light grey tone and understated embossed pattern blend effortlessly with modern, minimalist and classic décor, making these covers a practical choice for living rooms, bedrooms and guest spaces.","sku":"UK-7QC6MN","images":["/images/products/B0GJLDMT57/1.webp","/images/products/B0GJLDMT57/2.webp","/images/products/B0GJLDMT57/3.webp","/images/products/B0GJLDMT57/4.webp","/images/products/B0GJLDMT57/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true,false,false,false]},
  "b0gjlmjws1": {"title":"Set of 2 Embossed Geometric Microfiber Cushion Covers 50 x 70 cm, Soft Breathable Durable Pillowcases with Envelope Closure for Sofa Couch Bedroom Living Room Home Decor (Pink)","bullets":"Luxuriously Soft Microfiber: Woven from 100% microfiber, these cushion covers feel smooth, lightweight, and gentle against skin, providing a cozy layer for pillows on beds, sofas, and couches.\n\nElegant Embossed Texture: The subtle geometric embossed pattern adds a refined, decorative touch to bedrooms and living rooms while maintaining a smooth surface.\n\nEnvelope Closure for Easy Use: Each 50 x 70cm cover features a neat envelope closure that keeps pillow inserts securely tucked away without zippers or buttons, so dressing and removing them takes seconds.\n\nEasy Care & Fade Resistant: Machine washable and tumble dry friendly, the durable microfiber fabric holds its shape, color, and embossed detail through regular washing.\n\nBreathable & Well Made: Airy microfiber and tidy, reinforced seams help the covers stay comfortable and neat, making them a practical choice for everyday relaxation.","sku":"UK-69D7GP","images":["/images/products/B0GJLMJWS1/1.webp","/images/products/B0GJLMJWS1/2.webp","/images/products/B0GJLMJWS1/3.webp","/images/products/B0GJLMJWS1/4.webp","/images/products/B0GJLMJWS1/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,true,false]},
  "b0gd843wmn": {"title":"Set of 2 Embossed Microfibre Bed Pillows for Sleeping Soft Fluffy Hotel Style Supportive Pillow Cushions Breathable Skin Friendly Machine Washable Easy Care 40 x 80 cm (White)","bullets":"Cloud-Like Softness: Filled with plush microfibre, these pillows offer a gentle, cushioned feel that helps you relax and unwind at bedtime.\n\nSkin-Friendly Fabric: The embossed microfibre cover is soft to the touch and breathable, creating a comfortable sleeping environment night after night.\n\nEasy Care Design: Machine washable and tumble dry safe, these pillows maintain their shape and fresh look with no ironing required.\n\nWell-Made Details: Neatly finished seams and quality stitching give the cushions a clean, tailored appearance that fits standard pillowcases neatly.\n\nVersatile Two-Piece Set: Each pillow measures 40 x 80cm, making this pair a practical choice for bedrooms, guest rooms, and living room cushions.","sku":"DE-22YFCF","images":["/images/products/B0GD843WMN/studio-main.webp","/images/products/B0GD843WMN/scene.webp","/images/products/B0GD843WMN/studio-side.webp","/images/products/B0GD843WMN/studio-filling.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false]},
  "b0c4bd7q5x": {"title":"Set Of 2 Chair Cushions With Ties For Indoor Outdoor Dining Patio Garden Furniture Soft Durable Thickened Tufted Floral Printed Comfort Seat Pads 43 x 43 cm (Blue Red)","bullets":"Complete Two-Piece Set: Each order includes two matching square chair cushions measuring 43 x 43cm, giving your dining room, kitchen, patio, or garden chairs a coordinated and inviting look.\n\nStays Securely in Place: Corner fabric ties let you fasten each pad to chair backs or frames, helping reduce shifting and sliding as you sit and stand.\n\nSoft, Supportive Padding: A thick, tufted fill delivers comfortable cushioning and helps the seat pad maintain its shape through regular daily use.\n\nBold Botanical Style: The eye-catching floral design in blue and red tones against a neutral background adds a fresh, decorative accent to indoor and outdoor spaces.\n\nVersatile Indoor and Outdoor Use: Durable fabric and neatly finished edges make these cushions a practical choice for dining chairs, patio seating, deck furniture, and more.","sku":"US-QWWYNP","images":["/images/products/B0C4BD7Q5X/1.webp","/images/products/B0C4BD7Q5X/2.webp","/images/products/B0C4BD7Q5X/3.webp","/images/products/B0C4BD7Q5X/4.webp","/images/products/B0C4BD7Q5X/5.webp","/images/products/B0C4BD7Q5X/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,true,false,true,false]},
  "b0c4bcd4dy": {"title":"Set of 2 Square Chair Cushions Seat Pads with Ties Watercolor Floral Print Tufted Soft Comfortable Thick Dining Kitchen Patio Indoor Outdoor Decor 43 x 43 cm (Pink Flower)","bullets":"Set of 2 Chair Cushions: Includes two matching 43 x 43cm square seat pads, making it easy to refresh a pair of dining chairs, kitchen stools, or patio seats at once.\n\nPlush Tufted Comfort: Thick padded fill and soft-touch fabric provide a cushioned, supportive seat, while the tufted design helps each cushion keep its shape through daily use.\n\nWatercolor Floral Style: A bright, painterly bloom print in pink, teal, and green tones brings a fresh, cheerful look to indoor dining rooms and covered outdoor spaces.\n\nStay-Put Corner Ties: Two sturdy fabric ties at the back corners let you secure each cushion to chair backs or legs, so they stay in place as you sit and stand.\n\nVersatile Home Accent: Designed to fit a wide range of chairs, from wooden dining sets and kitchen seating to wicker patio chairs and home-office stools.","sku":"US-I84I58","images":["/images/products/B0C4BCD4DY/1.webp","/images/products/B0C4BCD4DY/2.webp","/images/products/B0C4BCD4DY/3.webp","/images/products/B0C4BCD4DY/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,true]},
  "b0grj8m3tm": {"title":"Makimoo Quilted Pillow Inserts 2 Pack Decorative Cushion Fillers Soft Fluffy Bed Pillows for Sofa Couch Bedroom Living Room Home Decor Support 40 x 80 cm (White)","bullets":"Quilted Diamond Pattern: Each pillow insert features a sophisticated diamond-quilted design that keeps the filling evenly distributed, preventing clumping and maintaining a smooth, plump appearance on your sofa, bed, or couch.\n\n2-Pack Value Set: This set includes two rectangular pillow inserts in a clean white finish, offering a coordinated look for your living room, bedroom, guest room, or any seating area that needs a fresh update.\n\nSoft and Supportive Fill: Filled with premium hollow fiber for a plush, cloud-like feel with reliable head and neck support, these inserts strike a comfortable balance between softness and structure for relaxing or sleeping.\n\nVersatile 40 x 80cm Size: Measuring 40 x 80cm, these cushion fillers fit standard pillow covers and sham sizes, making them ideal as decorative accent pillows, lumbar supports, or bed pillows in modern and classic home settings.\n\nDurable and Easy to Maintain: Crafted with quality stitching and a smooth microfiber cover, the inserts resist sagging and hold their shape over time; simply spot clean or machine wash on a gentle cycle for lasting freshness.","sku":"DE-1WZC3C","images":["/images/products/B0GRJ8M3TM/studio-main.webp","/images/products/B0GRJ8M3TM/scene.webp","/images/products/B0GRJ8M3TM/studio-side.webp","/images/products/B0GRJ8M3TM/studio-filling.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false]},
  "b0c4bc7q4s": {"title":"Makimoo Chair Cushions 2 Pack with Ties for Dining Kitchen Patio Office, Soft Padded Seat Cushion Pads, Non-Slip Tufted Chair Pads Indoor Outdoor, 43 x 43 cm (Khaki Floral)","bullets":"Set of 2 Padded Seat Cushions: Includes two generously filled chair pads with attached ties, designed to add comfort and style to dining chairs, kitchen stools, patio seating, or office chairs.\n\nVibrant Khaki Floral Pattern: Features an eye-catching bohemian-inspired floral print in warm red, blue, green, and neutral tones that complements both indoor and outdoor decor themes.\n\nSecure Ties & Non-Slip Design: Each cushion includes durable fabric ties to fasten securely to chair backs or frames, helping keep the pad in place during daily use.\n\nSoft, Supportive Comfort: Filled with plush padding and tufted for even distribution, these 43 x 43cm cushions provide gentle support for extended sitting at meals, work, or gatherings.\n\nVersatile for Multiple Spaces: Ideal for dining rooms, kitchens, patios, gardens, offices, and cafes, these seat cushions bring a cozy, decorative touch to hardwood, metal, or wicker chairs.","sku":"US-UHHA16","images":["/images/products/B0C4BC7Q4S/1.webp","/images/products/B0C4BC7Q4S/2.webp","/images/products/B0C4BC7Q4S/3.webp","/images/products/B0C4BC7Q4S/4.webp","/images/products/B0C4BC7Q4S/5.webp","/images/products/B0C4BC7Q4S/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,true,true,false]},
  "b0c2zcxvx7": {"title":"Makimoo Hump-Shaped Memory Foam Travel Neck Pillow with Adjustable Toggle Strap Zippered Soft Velvet Cover Ergonomic Head Support for Airplane Car Train Office Napping (Blue)","bullets":"Ergonomic Hump Design: The contoured shape cradles your neck, chin, and head to help maintain natural alignment during flights, road trips, train rides, or office naps.\n\nResponsive Memory Foam Core: High-density memory foam gently molds to your contours and rebounds slowly, delivering consistent cushioning without flattening.\n\nAdjustable Toggle Strap: A sturdy cord with an easy-slide lock lets you customize the fit around your neck, keeping the pillow secure as you relax or sleep upright.\n\nSoft Velvet and Breathable Mesh Cover: The plush velvet exterior feels gentle on skin, while the breathable mesh panel helps airflow; the zippered design allows convenient removal for cleaning.\n\nCompact Travel Set: Includes a lightweight drawstring storage bag so you can roll the pillow down, tuck it away, and carry it in your luggage, backpack, or handbag.","sku":"US-MLYJLF","images":["/images/products/B0C2ZCXVX7/1.webp","/images/products/B0C2ZCXVX7/2.webp","/images/products/B0C2ZCXVX7/3.webp","/images/products/B0C2ZCXVX7/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,true,true,true]},
  "b0c2z9pffk": {"title":"Makimoo Memory Foam Travel Neck Pillow Ergonomic Hump Shaped Design Soft Supportive Cushion with Adjustable Drawstring Carry Bag for Airplane Car Train Office Naps (Grey)","bullets":"Ergonomic Hump Design: The contoured shape cradles your neck, chin, and head to help maintain natural alignment while seated, making long flights, road trips, and commutes more comfortable.\n\nPremium Memory Foam Core: Made with high-density slow-rebound memory foam that gently molds to your curves and returns to shape after use, providing consistent support without flattening.\n\nAdjustable Drawstring Closure: A sturdy cord with a spring-loaded toggle lets you tighten or loosen the fit around your neck, keeping the pillow secure whether you lean back or to the side.\n\nSoft Breathable Cover: The outer plush fabric feels gentle against skin, while the inner mesh lining promotes airflow to help you stay cool and relaxed during rest.\n\nTravel-Friendly Carry Bag: The included lightweight drawstring pouch keeps the pillow clean and compact, so you can easily tuck it into a backpack, suitcase, or tote.","sku":"US-TA9C0Y","images":["/images/products/B0C2Z9PFFK/1.webp","/images/products/B0C2Z9PFFK/2.webp","/images/products/B0C2Z9PFFK/3.webp","/images/products/B0C2Z9PFFK/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true,true,true]},
  "b0bzcmdzns": {"title":"U Shaped Memory Foam Neck Pillow With Adjustable Snap Closure Soft Velvet Removable Cover Travel Pillow For Airplane Car Train Office Napping With Compact Carry Bag (Grey)","bullets":"Ergonomic Memory Foam Support: The contoured U-shape gently cradles your neck and head to help maintain natural alignment and reduce fatigue during long flights, road trips, train rides, or office breaks.\n\nAdjustable Snap Closure: A sturdy buckle with multiple snap settings lets you secure the pillow loosely or snugly around your neck, giving you personalized comfort and stable support while sleeping upright.\n\nSoft Velvet Removable Cover: The plush, breathable velvet cover feels smooth against skin and unzips easily for quick removal and machine washing, keeping your pillow fresh trip after trip.\n\nCompact Travel Design: The pillow rolls up neatly into the included drawstring carry bag, saving valuable luggage space and protecting the pillow from dust when stored at home or on the go.\n\nVersatile Everyday Comfort: Ideal for airplanes, cars, buses, trains, camping, and desk naps, this pillow offers reliable neck support for adults and teens during commutes, vacations, and relaxing afternoons.","sku":"US-Z03AX2","images":["/images/products/B0BZCMDZNS/1.webp","/images/products/B0BZCMDZNS/2.webp","/images/products/B0BZCMDZNS/3.webp","/images/products/B0BZCMDZNS/4.webp","/images/products/B0BZCMDZNS/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true,false,false,false]},
  "b0bzcln57s": {"title":"Makimoo Memory Foam Travel Neck Pillow U Shaped With Adjustable Snap Closure Portable Drawstring Bag Breathable Soft Cover For Airplane Car Train Bus Home Office Naps (Black)","bullets":"360-Degree Ergonomic Neck Support: The U-shaped design wraps gently around your neck and chin to help keep your head upright and aligned while sitting. It helps reduce neck strain during long flights, road trips, train rides, or bus commutes.\n\nPremium Memory Foam Filling: Made with responsive memory foam combined with microbeads, this pillow molds to the natural curve of your neck and returns to shape within 5 seconds. The balanced softness and support help relieve pressure points for more relaxed rest.\n\nBreathable and Sweat-Resistant Cover: The soft velvet-like cover allows airflow to help keep you cool and comfortable during extended use. It feels gentle against skin and resists sweat buildup, making it suitable for warm cabins or long journeys.\n\nAdjustable Snap Closure with Travel Bag: A side snap button lets you secure the pillow comfortably under your chin or attach it to a bag when not in use. The included lightweight drawstring bag makes packing and carrying easy for travel.\n\nLightweight and Versatile for Anywhere: Use it on airplanes, in cars, on trains or buses, or while relaxing at home or in the office. Its compact, portable design makes it a practical companion for commuting, napping, reading, or watching TV.","sku":"US-CQ168O","images":["/images/products/B0BZCLN57S/1.webp","/images/products/B0BZCLN57S/2.webp","/images/products/B0BZCLN57S/3.webp","/images/products/B0BZCLN57S/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,true]},
  "b0bxckknn8": {"title":"Makimoo Travel Neck Pillow Memory Foam U-Shaped Support with Hump Design Adjustable Strap Soft Breathable Removable Cover Machine Washable for Airplane Car Office Rest (Black)","bullets":"Ergonomic Hump Design for Comfortable Support: The contoured U-shaped memory foam gently cradles your head, neck, and chin to help maintain natural alignment while you rest during flights, road trips, or train rides.\n\nPremium Slow-Rebound Memory Foam Core: High-density memory foam adapts to your unique shape and provides balanced cushioning that relieves pressure points, then slowly returns to its original form after each use.\n\nSoft, Breathable and Machine-Washable Cover: The skin-friendly outer fabric features breathable mesh panels to keep air flowing, while the zippered cover removes easily for convenient cleaning between trips.\n\nAdjustable Toggle Closure for a Secure Fit: The front cord lock lets you tighten or loosen the pillow around your neck, so it stays comfortably in place whether you are sitting upright in a plane or reclining in a car.\n\nTravel-Ready with a Compact Carry Bag: Lightweight and compressible, this neck pillow includes a drawstring storage bag that keeps it clean and easy to pack in your carry-on, backpack, or luggage.","sku":"US-Y6J0CA","images":["/images/products/B0BXCKKNN8/1.webp","/images/products/B0BXCKKNN8/2.webp","/images/products/B0BXCKKNN8/3.webp","/images/products/B0BXCKKNN8/4.webp","/images/products/B0BXCKKNN8/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false]},
  "b0c4bbvs53": {"title":"Makimoo Square Chair Cushions Set of 2 Thick Tufted Seat Pads with Ties for Indoor Outdoor Patio Kitchen Dining Chairs Soft All-Weather Fabric for Home and Garden 43 x 43 cm (Blue Paisley)","bullets":"Plush, Supportive Seating: Each cushion is generously filled and tufted to deliver soft, even support across the entire seat, making wooden, metal, or wicker chairs more comfortable for long dinners, workdays, or relaxed outdoor lounging.\n\nSecure Tie-Back Design: Two sturdy matching fabric ties on each pad let you fasten the cushion firmly to chair backs or rails, helping it stay centered and in place when you sit down, shift, or stand up.\n\nVersatile Indoor and Outdoor Look: The eye-catching blue paisley print blends turquoise, coral, cream, and navy tones, adding a lively finishing touch to kitchen chairs, dining sets, patio seating, and home office chairs.\n\nMade for Everyday Use: Constructed from durable fabric with a tight weave, these cushions retain their shape and vibrant print through regular indoor and outdoor seating, so they look fresh meal after meal.\n\nReady-to-Use Two-Pack: The set includes two coordinating 43 x 43cm chair pads, so you can instantly refresh a pair of dining chairs or mix and match across your indoor and outdoor spaces.","sku":"US-8DAI6W","images":["/images/products/B0C4BBVS53/1.webp","/images/products/B0C4BBVS53/2.webp","/images/products/B0C4BBVS53/3.webp","/images/products/B0C4BBVS53/4.webp","/images/products/B0C4BBVS53/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,true,false,true]},
  "1688-856468238034": {"title":"Premium 2-Pack Cotton Bath Towels Extra Soft Highly Absorbent 21-Ply Ringspun Cotton Yarn Hotel Spa Quality Large Towels for Bathroom Gym Sports and Travel 140 x 80 cm (Orange)","bullets":"Premium Cotton Construction: Woven from pure cotton with 21-ply yarn, these towels offer a plush, soft feel against the skin. The dense terry loops create a comfortable texture that holds up through daily use.\n\nExcellent Absorbency: Thick cotton fibers quickly wick away moisture after showers, workouts, swimming, or spa visits. The generous pile soaks up water efficiently to leave skin feeling dry and refreshed.\n\nGenerous Full Size: Each towel measures 140 x 80cm, providing ample coverage for adults. The large surface wraps comfortably around the body and works well as a bath towel or travel companion.\n\nVersatile for Any Occasion: Ideal for home bathrooms, hotel suites, gyms, yoga studios, beaches, and camping trips. The solid color design complements a wide range of decor styles.\n\nBuilt to Last: Reinforced edges and quality stitching help prevent fraying over time. Machine washable for easy care, these towels maintain their softness and absorbency through repeated washes.","sku":"US-VK9EJ3","images":["/images/products/1688-856468238034/1.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034/2.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034/3.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034/4.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034/5.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034/6.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034/7.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,true,false,false,false,false,false]},
  "1688-743666513356-c7": {"title":"Premium 2 Pack Cotton Bath Towels Large 80 x 140 cm Hotel Inspired Plush Soft Highly Absorbent Durable Long Staple Cotton Towel Set for Bathroom Shower Travel Dorm (Blue)","bullets":"Luxurious Long-Staple Cotton: Woven from quality long-staple cotton fibers, these towels feel exceptionally soft against skin and provide a cozy, spa-like wrap after every bath or shower.\n\nGenerous 80 x 140cm Coverage: Each towel is sized to drape comfortably around adults, offering ample surface area for quick, effective drying at home, the gym, or while traveling.\n\nDense 32-Ply Absorbency: The thick cotton construction quickly pulls moisture away from your body and hair, helping you stay comfortably dry without excessive rubbing.\n\nBuilt to Last: Reinforced double-stitched hems resist fraying and help the towels maintain their shape, color, and plush feel through regular washing and daily use.\n\nMatching 2-Piece Set in Classic Blue: This set includes two coordinated bath towels in a versatile blue tone that blends easily with modern, traditional, or hotel-style bathroom décor.","sku":"US-9RWTBJ","images":["/images/products/1688-743666513356-C7/1.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C7/2.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C7/3.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C7/4.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C7/5.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C7/6.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C7/7.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,false,false,false,false,false,true]},
  "1688-743666513356-c6": {"title":"Plush Ring Spun Cotton Bath Towels 2 Pack Quick Dry Highly Absorbent Soft Oversized Hotel Inspired Bath Sheets for Bathroom Gym Spa Travel Daily Use 80 x 140 cm (Grey)","bullets":"Generous Full-Body Coverage: Each bath towel measures 80 x 140cm, giving adults plenty of wrap-around coverage after showers, baths, swims, or gym visits.\n\nSoft Ring-Spun Cotton: Crafted from ring-spun cotton for a plush, gentle touch against skin while quickly wicking away moisture.\n\nQuick-Drying & Breathable: The breathable weave allows air to flow through the fabric, helping towels dry faster between uses and stay fresh.\n\nBuilt to Last: Reinforced edges and dense stitching reduce fraying and shedding, keeping the towels soft and intact wash after wash.\n\nVersatile 2-Pack Set: Includes two matching grey towels that suit home bathrooms, guest rooms, spas, hotels, fitness centers, and travel bags.","sku":"US-5R5Q69","images":["/images/products/1688-743666513356-C6/1.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C6/2.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C6/3.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C6/4.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C6/5.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C6/6.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C6/7.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,false,false,false,false,false,true]},
  "1688-856468238034-c4": {"title":"2 Pack Premium Black Bath Towels Made of Pure Cotton 21S Yarn Soft Highly Absorbent Quick Dry Large Bathroom Towel for Gym Sports Travel Home Hotel 80 x 140 cm (Black)","bullets":"Premium Cotton Construction: Woven from pure cotton 21-count yarn, these towels offer a naturally soft and breathable touch that feels gentle against skin after every bath or workout.\n\nHighly Absorbent and Quick-Drying: The thick terry loop surface quickly wicks away moisture, helping you dry off faster while keeping the fabric fresh and ready for daily use.\n\nGenerous Full-Size Coverage: Each towel measures 80 x 140cm, providing ample wrap-around coverage for adults and making it suitable for home bathrooms, gyms, hotels, and travel.\n\nStrong and Long-Lasting: Reinforced edges and a dense 21-count yarn weave resist fraying and help the towels maintain their shape and texture through regular washing.\n\nVersatile 2-Pack Value: This set includes two classic black towels that work equally well as bath towels, fitness towels, or reliable travel companions for active lifestyles.","sku":"US-00X8RG","images":["/images/products/1688-856468238034-C4/1.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034-C4/2.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034-C4/3.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034-C4/4.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034-C4/5.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034-C4/6.webp","/images/products/1688-856468238034-C4/7.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,false,false,false,false,false,true]},
  "1688-743666513356-c4": {"title":"Premium 2 Pack American Style Cotton Bath Towels Extra Thick Highly Absorbent Soft Plush Towel Set for Bathroom Home Hotel Spa Gym Travel Daily Use 70 x 140 cm (Beige)","bullets":"100% Natural Cotton Construction: Crafted from pure cotton fibers, these bath towels offer a naturally soft and gentle touch against skin. The breathable material quickly wicks away moisture after bathing, swimming, or workouts.\n\nGenerous Full-Body Coverage: Each towel measures 70 x 140cm, providing ample wrap-around coverage for adults. The large rectangular design makes drying off comfortable and efficient from head to toe.\n\nThick Plush 380G Weight: Woven with a substantial 380-gram construction, the towels feel thick and cozy while remaining absorbent. The textured surface brings a spa-like experience to your daily routine.\n\nClassic American Style Design: Featuring a clean, timeless look with refined border detailing, these towels complement modern bathrooms, guest rooms, hotels, and spas. The neutral beige tone blends easily with existing decor.\n\nPractical 2-Pack Value Set: Includes two matching towels ideal for everyday home use, travel, gym sessions, or hospitality settings. Machine washable for simple care and long-lasting softness with proper maintenance.","sku":"US-ON9BCN","images":["/images/products/1688-743666513356-C4/1.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C4/2.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C4/3.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C4/4.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C4/5.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C4/6.webp","/images/products/1688-743666513356-C4/7.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,true,true]},
  "1688-1044064113195-c3": {"title":"2 Pack Luxury Bath Towels 100% Cotton Hotel Spa Towel Set Extra Large Highly Absorbent Thick Plush Terry Soft Fast Drying Oversized Body Towels for Adults 70 x 140 cm (Grey)","bullets":"Premium 100% Cotton Build: Made from pure natural cotton with dense terry loops, these towels feel plush against skin and hold up beautifully through daily use.\n\nOversized 70 x 140cm Coverage: Each towel in this 2-pack offers generous full-body wrap-around coverage for adults after bathing, swimming, or a relaxing spa session.\n\nHighly Absorbent 600g Terry: Thick cotton terry quickly draws moisture away from skin while staying breathable and easy to dry between uses.\n\nElegant Hotel-Inspired Style: Classic white body with refined grey striped borders adds a clean, sophisticated touch to home bathrooms, guest rooms, and vacation rentals.\n\nStays Soft Wash After Wash: Combed cotton fibers resist roughness and shedding, maintaining a smooth, comfortable feel even with frequent laundering.","sku":"US-Y2BJC3","images":["/images/products/1688-1044064113195-C3/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1044064113195-C3/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1044064113195-C3/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1044064113195-C3/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1044064113195-C3/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,true,true,false]},
  "1688-1056325209172-c2": {"title":"4 Pack 100 Percent Cotton Hand Towels Hotel Spa Style 40 x 80 cm Thick Terry Highly Absorbent Quick Dry Face Towels Soft Washcloths for Bathroom Kitchen Gym Travel (Grey)","bullets":"Premium Cotton Construction: Made from 100% natural cotton, these 40 x 80cm towels offer a soft, plush feel against skin. The long-staple cotton fibers create a smooth surface that remains gentle for daily face and hand drying.\n\nThick, Absorbent Terry Weave: Designed with dense, extended loop piles, each 180g towel quickly draws moisture away from skin. The thickened terry construction helps you dry off efficiently after washing or bathing.\n\nQuick-Drying and Breathable: The lightweight yet substantial cotton fabric allows air to circulate, helping towels dry faster between uses. Ideal for bathrooms, gyms, travel bags, and guest suites.\n\nElegant Hotel-Inspired Design: Crisp white body with refined grey accent stripes adds a clean, modern touch to any bathroom decor. The classic border detail offers a polished look that complements home, hotel, or spa settings.\n\nSet of Four for Everyday Use: This pack includes four matching face towels, providing enough coverage for family members, visitors, or rotation. Each towel is machine washable and retains its shape and softness through regular laundering.","sku":"US-4PNRL1","images":["/images/products/1688-1056325209172-C2/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1056325209172-C2/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1056325209172-C2/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1056325209172-C2/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1056325209172-C2/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1056325209172-C2/6.webp","/images/products/1688-1056325209172-C2/7.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,false,false,false,false,false,true]},
  "1688-1056325209172": {"title":"4 Pack Luxury Hotel Collection 100 Percent Cotton Face Towels Thick Absorbent Terry Towel Set with Platinum Stripe Quick Dry Soft Washcloths for Bathroom Spa Gym 40 x 80 cm (White)","bullets":"Luxury Hotel Comfort at Home: Enjoy spa-like softness with this 4-piece cotton towel set. The thick, plush terry fabric feels gentle on skin and adds an elegant hotel touch to any bathroom.\n\nHighly Absorbent Cotton: Long-staple cotton loops draw moisture away from your face, hands, and hair quickly, keeping you dry and comfortable after every wash.\n\nThick Yet Fast-Drying: Each towel weighs 180g for a substantial, cozy feel while remaining breathable enough to dry quickly between daily uses.\n\nVersatile Everyday Size: At 40 x 80cm, these towels offer ample coverage for face washing, gym workouts, travel, guest rooms, and more.\n\nBuilt to Last: Reinforced edges help prevent fraying and maintain shape through regular machine washing. The classic white body with platinum-toned trim suits any décor.","sku":"US-MLN2FF","images":["/images/products/1688-1056325209172/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1056325209172/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1056325209172/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1056325209172/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1056325209172/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1056325209172/6.webp","/images/products/1688-1056325209172/7.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,false,false,false,false,false,true]},
  "1688-1044064113195-c2": {"title":"2 Pack Pure Cotton Bath Towels Oversized Extra Thick Highly Absorbent Quick Dry Soft Plush Terry Towel Set for Bathroom Hotel Spa for Daily Use 80 x 160 cm (Champagne Gold)","bullets":"Hotel-Inspired Cotton Comfort: Made from pure natural cotton terry, these oversized bath towels offer a plush, resort-style feel that wraps you in softness after every shower or bath.\n\nGenerous Full-Body Coverage: Each towel measures 80 x 160cm, providing ample coverage for adults and making drying quick and comfortable at home, the gym, the spa, or while traveling.\n\nHighly Absorbent & Fast Drying: The thick, dense looped weave quickly wicks moisture away from skin and dries efficiently between uses, so you always reach for a fresh, ready towel.\n\nSoft, Low-Lint & Gentle on Skin: Combed cotton fibers help reduce shedding and pilling, creating a smooth, skin-friendly surface that stays soft and inviting wash after wash.\n\nElegant Style & Practical Value: A crisp white body with refined champagne gold border stripes adds a clean, sophisticated touch to any bathroom, while the 2-pack set gives you a coordinated pair for daily use or guests.","sku":"US-LJJXWH","images":["/images/products/1688-1044064113195-C2/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1044064113195-C2/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1044064113195-C2/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1044064113195-C2/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1044064113195-C2/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false]},
  "1688-1044064113195": {"title":"2 Pack Oversized Bath Towels 100% Cotton Hotel Style Highly Absorbent Thick Plush Ring Spun Soft Extra Large Towel for Bathroom Spa Gym Pool Quick Dry 80 x 160 cm (Grey)","bullets":"Premium Long-Staple Cotton: Woven from 100% natural cotton with dense, twisted loops, these towels deliver a thick and plush touch that feels gentle on skin. The breathable fibers hold up well through daily use and frequent laundering.\n\nHigh Absorbency: The heavyweight, high-pile construction quickly pulls moisture away from your body; simply press the towel against skin after bathing or swimming to feel comfortably dry.\n\nOversized 80 x 160cm Design: Each towel provides generous full-body coverage for adults, making it ideal for home bathrooms, hotel suites, spas, gyms, pools, and beach trips.\n\nDurable Hotel-Inspired Finish: A clean white base with an elegant grey border gives a refined look, while reinforced edges and tight stitching help prevent fraying and maintain softness over time.\n\nEasy-Care Two-Towel Set: Includes two generously sized towels that are machine washable and dryer friendly, offering a practical upgrade for family homes, guest rooms, vacation rentals, and fitness centers.","sku":"US-U2HP6L","images":["/images/products/1688-1044064113195/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1044064113195/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1044064113195/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1044064113195/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1044064113195/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1044064113195/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,false]},
  "1688-916370884976-c5": {"title":"Bedding Set 4 Pcs Washed Cotton Soft Breathable Skin Friendly Reversible Two-Tone, With Zipper Closure 230 x 200 cm (Light Blue & Cheese)","bullets":"Soft Washed Cotton Fabric: Crafted from washed cotton for a naturally soft, breathable, and skin-friendly feel that helps you relax and unwind night after night.\n\nReversible Two-Tone Style: Features a clean solid light blue front with a cheese-yellow reverse, giving you two fresh looks in one set to complement modern bedrooms, dorms, and guest rooms.\n\nComplete 4-Piece Set: Includes 1 duvet cover measuring 230 x 200cm, 1 fitted sheet measuring 152 x 203 cm, and 2 pillowcases measuring 74 x 48cm, providing a coordinated foundation for a tidy, pulled-together bed.\n\nEasy Everyday Care: Machine washable and designed to keep its smooth texture and color wash after wash, making it a practical choice for busy households, students, and apartment living.\n\nVersatile Bedroom Essential: Lightweight and easy to pair with existing decor, this set works beautifully in master bedrooms, guest rooms, dormitories, and vacation rentals.","sku":"US-0F3F9X","images":["/images/products/1688-916370884976-C5/1.webp","/images/products/1688-916370884976-C5/2.webp","/images/products/1688-916370884976-C5/3.webp","/images/products/1688-916370884976-C5/4.webp","/images/products/1688-916370884976-C5/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false]},
