  "bedset4-gray-king": {"title":"Makimoo King Size Bedding Set 4 Piece Duvet Cover with Fitted Sheet and 2 Pillowcases Soft Breathable Microfiber Wrinkle Resistant All Season Bed Linens 104 x 90 in (Grey)","bullets":"Complete 4-Piece Set: This king bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (104 x 90 in), 1 fitted sheet (78 x 80 in), and 2 pillowcases (20 x 36 in), giving your bed a fully coordinated finish.\n\nSoft Microfiber Fabric: Made from brushed microfiber that feels smooth and gentle against the skin while remaining lightweight for a cozy night's rest.\n\nAll-Season Comfort: The breathable fabric helps regulate temperature, keeping you comfortable during warmer nights and snug when the weather turns cool.\n\nSecure Fitted Sheet: The elasticized fitted sheet wraps around your mattress and stays in place, so your bed looks tidy and feels comfortable all night long.\n\nEasy Care & Long-Lasting: Machine washable and designed to resist fading, shrinking and wrinkles, maintaining a clean, inviting look after repeated washes.","sku":"US-9JGRZT","images":["/images/products/BEDSET4-GRAY-KING/1.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-GRAY-KING/2.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true]},
  "bedset4-gray-queen": {"title":"Makimoo Queen Duvet Cover Set 4 Pieces with Fitted Sheet and 2 Pillowcases Soft Breathable Cozy Durable Bedding Easy Care Machine Washable Home Hotel Style 88 x 88 in (Grey)","bullets":"Complete Queen Bedding Set: Includes 1 duvet cover measuring 88 x 88 in, 1 fitted sheet measuring 60 x 80 in, and 2 pillowcases measuring 20 x 30 in, giving your bed a fully coordinated finish.\n\nSoft and Breathable Fabric: Made with a smooth, lightweight fabric that feels gentle on skin and helps create a comfortable sleep environment all year round.\n\nThoughtful Construction: The duvet cover allows for quick insert changes, while the fitted sheet wraps smoothly around your mattress to keep everything looking neat and tidy.\n\nEasy Care and Durable: This set is machine washable and holds up well to regular use, so you can enjoy a fresh-looking bed with minimal effort.\n\nVersatile Grey Design: The understated grey color and clean lines complement a wide range of bedroom styles, from modern to classic.","sku":"US-CUK4PP","images":["/images/products/BEDSET4-GRAY-QUEEN/1.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-GRAY-QUEEN/2.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true]},
  "bedset4-gray-full": {"title":"Makimoo Full Duvet Cover Set 4 Pieces with Fitted Sheet and 2 Pillowcases Soft Breathable Wrinkle Resistant Microfiber Bedding, 80 x 88 in (Grey)","bullets":"Complete Full Bedding Set: This coordinated 4-piece Makimoo set includes 1 duvet cover (80 x 88 in), 1 fitted sheet (54 x 75 in), and 2 pillowcases (20 x 26 in), giving your full-size bed a polished, put-together look.\n\nSoft and Breathable Microfiber: Woven from premium microfiber, this duvet cover set offers a smooth, gentle feel against the skin while allowing airflow to help keep you comfortable in any season.\n\nSecure All-Around Elastic Fit: The fitted sheet is designed with a full elastic edge that hugs your mattress snugly, helping it stay flat and in place from night to morning.\n\nEasy Care and Long-Lasting Color: Machine washable for everyday convenience, the fabric resists fading and wrinkles to maintain a fresh, inviting appearance over time.\n\nTimeless Grey for Any Decor: The understated grey shade pairs effortlessly with modern, classic, or cozy bedroom styles, making it a versatile choice for your full bedding refresh.","sku":"US-DJ397A","images":["/images/products/BEDSET4-GRAY-FULL/1.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-GRAY-FULL/2.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true]},
  "bedset4-gray-twin": {"title":"Makimoo Twin Bedding Set 4 Piece Duvet Cover Set with Fitted Sheet and 2 Pillowcases, Soft Brushed Microfiber, Breathable Wrinkle Resistant, 68 x 88 in (Grey)","bullets":"Complete Twin Bedding Ensemble: The set includes 1 Duvet Cover 68 x 88 in, 1 Fitted Sheet 39 x 75 in, and 2 Pillowcases 20 x 26 in, giving you a coordinated foundation for a twin bed.\n\nSoft Brushed Microfiber: Woven from lightweight microfiber for a smooth, breathable feel that helps maintain a comfortable sleeping temperature throughout the night.\n\nStay-Put Fitted Sheet: The elasticized fitted sheet hugs standard twin mattresses securely, while the duvet cover drapes neatly over your comforter for a clean, layered look.\n\nEasy Care & Wrinkle Resistant: Machine washable and quick drying, this set resists wrinkles and fading so it looks refreshed with minimal effort.\n\nVersatile Neutral Style: The understated Grey tone pairs easily with a wide range of bedroom palettes and existing linens for a timeless, adaptable finish.","sku":"US-LLYHCC","images":["/images/products/BEDSET4-GRAY-TWIN/1.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-GRAY-TWIN/2.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true]},
  "bedset4-white-king": {"title":"King Size Bedding Set 4 Pieces Soft Brushed Microfiber Duvet Cover Fitted Sheet Pillowcases Hotel Style Breathable Wrinkle Resistant Fade Resistant 104 x 90 in (White)","bullets":"Complete 4-Piece King Bedding Set: Includes 1 duvet cover (104 x 90 in), 1 fitted sheet (78 x 80 in), and 2 pillowcases (20 x 36 in) for a fully coordinated bed.\n\nSoft Brushed Microfiber Comfort: Made from finely brushed microfiber that feels smooth and gentle against the skin, helping you relax into a comfortable night's sleep.\n\nBreathable and Lightweight: The airy fabric allows heat to escape so you stay cool and comfortable throughout the night without feeling weighed down.\n\nWrinkle and Fade Resistant: Engineered to resist wrinkles and color fading, this set keeps its crisp white look wash after wash with minimal ironing needed.\n\nEasy Care Machine Washable: Simply toss the set in the washing machine on a gentle cycle and tumble dry low for quick, convenient cleaning and long-lasting softness.","sku":"US-WSU4TO","images":["/images/products/BEDSET4-WHITE-KING/1.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-WHITE-KING/2.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true]},
  "bedset4-white-queen": {"title":"Makimoo Queen Size Bedding Set 4 Pieces Premium Ultra Soft Cozy Breathable Microfiber All Season Duvet Cover Set Fitted Sheet Pillowcases Easy Care 88 x 88 in (White)","bullets":"Complete 4-Piece Set: Includes 1 duvet cover (88 x 88 in), 1 fitted sheet (60 x 80 in), and 2 pillowcases (20 x 30 in). The coordinated package provides all essential pieces for a polished, refreshed bed.\n\nPremium Microfiber Fabric: Crafted from brushed microfiber that feels exceptionally soft and smooth against your skin. The lightweight material creates a cozy, inviting sleep surface night after night.\n\nBreathable All-Season Comfort: The airy microfiber construction helps promote airflow, keeping you comfortable through every season. Enjoy a fresh, balanced feel that supports restful sleep year-round.\n\nEasy Care and Durable: Machine washable for convenient cleaning and made with sturdy microfiber that holds up well to regular use. Reinforced stitching adds strength for everyday enjoyment.\n\nElegant Versatile Style: The clean white color and simple design complement a wide range of bedroom decor, from modern minimalist to classic traditional. Create a calm, welcoming atmosphere in your sleeping space.","sku":"US-3AX7W3","images":["/images/products/BEDSET4-WHITE-QUEEN/1.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-WHITE-QUEEN/2.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false]},
  "bedset4-white-full": {"title":"Makimoo Full Bedding Set 4 Piece Soft Breathable Comfortable Easy Care All Season Lightweight Modern Duvet Cover with Fitted Sheet and Pillowcases 80 x 88 in (White)","bullets":"Complete 4-Piece Set: This full bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (80 x 88 in), 1 fitted sheet (54 x 75 in), and 2 pillowcases (20 x 26 in), giving your bed a coordinated finish with all the essentials.\n\nSoft Breathable Comfort: The lightweight fabric feels smooth against skin and allows air to circulate, helping you stay comfortable through warm nights and cool mornings.\n\nSecure Fitted Sheet Fit: The fitted sheet features a fully elasticized edge that wraps under the mattress to hold corners firmly in place without slipping during the night.\n\nSimple Everyday Care: This set is machine washable and designed to maintain a neat, fresh look after regular washing, making it a practical choice for busy households.\n\nTimeless Versatile Style: The crisp white color and clean design pair easily with any bedroom decor, suitable for master suites, guest rooms, apartments, and dorm rooms.","sku":"US-JNTZOO","images":["/images/products/BEDSET4-WHITE-FULL/1.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-WHITE-FULL/2.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true]},
  "bedset4-white-twin": {"title":"Makimoo Twin Bedding Set 4 Piece Duvet Cover Fitted Sheet Pillowcases Soft Brushed Microfiber Breathable Lightweight Wrinkle Resistant Easy Care, 68 x 88 in (White)","bullets":"Premium Microfiber Comfort: Woven from ultra-soft brushed microfiber, this bedding set offers a smooth, breathable feel that keeps you comfortable through every season. The lightweight fabric drapes neatly and resists wrinkles, fading, and pilling for a fresh look with everyday use.\n\nComplete 4-Piece Twin Set: Includes everything you need for a coordinated bed: 1 duvet cover (68 x 88 in), 1 fitted sheet (39 x 75 in), and 2 pillowcases (20 x 26 in). Each piece is sized to fit standard Twin mattresses and pillows with a clean, tailored finish.\n\nTailored Fitted Sheet: The fitted sheet features elasticized edges that stretch smoothly around your mattress, helping it stay in place through the night. Its streamlined design makes bed-making quick and easy while maintaining a neat appearance.\n\nClean Classic Style: The crisp solid-white finish brings a bright, airy look to any bedroom, guest room, or dorm. The minimalist design pairs effortlessly with quilts, throw blankets, and decorative pillows for a personalized touch.\n\nEasy Everyday Care: Machine washable and quick to dry, this set is designed for busy lifestyles. The colorfast microfiber retains its soft hand and clean look wash after wash, so your bed always feels inviting.","sku":"US-L2VBVO","images":["/images/products/BEDSET4-WHITE-TWIN/1.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-WHITE-TWIN/2.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false]},
  "1688-1048207560416": {"title":"Cooling Washed Ice Silk Dual Tone Duvet Cover Reversible Soft Breathable Lightweight Smooth Cozy Machine Washable Bedding For Bedroom Guest Room 220 x 180 cm (Milkshake White)","bullets":"WHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (180 x 220cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nCOOLING WASHED ICE SILK: The washed ice silk fabric has a smooth, silky-soft surface that feels cool and gentle against the skin, helping you stay comfortable in warmer rooms.\n\nDUAL TONE REVERSIBLE STYLE: The dual tone design gives you two complementary looks in one cover. Flip the duvet cover to refresh the look of your bedroom, guest room, or dorm.\n\nSOFT BREATHABLE COMFORT: Lightweight and breathable, this duvet cover drapes smoothly over your bed without feeling heavy. The soft texture adds a cozy layer for relaxing and sleeping.\n\nEASY CARE AND VERSATILE USE: Machine washable for convenient upkeep, this cooling duvet cover is easy to maintain. It works well as a standalone cover or as a layer over your comforter.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1048207560416/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1048207560416/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1048207560416/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1048207560416/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1048207560416/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1048207560416/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c2": {"title":"Luxurious Silky Cooling Duvet Cover for Hot Sleepers, Smooth Breathable Solid Color Bedding, Lightweight Comforter Protector, Vintage Milk Tea Style, 180 x 220 cm (Beige)","bullets":"SILKY COOLING TOUCH: The finely woven ice-silk style surface feels distinctly cool and satin-smooth against the skin, which helps hot sleepers settle in without tossing. Its fluid drape glides over the comforter instead of clinging, so the bedding stays neat and comfortable through the night.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (180 x 220cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nBREATHABLE AND LIGHTWEIGHT: The airy weave allows warm air to escape and moves moisture away from the body, keeping the fabric feeling fresh rather than heavy or stuffy. Light in weight yet substantial enough to fall in soft folds, it layers easily over any insert for a clean, tailored look.\n\nELEGANT VINTAGE MILK TEA TONE: A muted beige with a subtle sheen brings a calm, understated warmth to bedrooms, guest rooms, and dorm spaces. The solid color blends naturally with light wood, white, and cream furniture, and it stays stylish as your room decor changes.\n\nTHOUGHTFUL DETAILS AND EASY CARE: A hidden zipper along the bottom keeps the insert out of sight and makes changing the cover quick, while inner corner ties hold the comforter in place. Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle and tumble dry low to keep the surface smooth and ready to use.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C2/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C2/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C2/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C2/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C2/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C2/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c3": {"title":"Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Silky Smooth Soft Breathable Solid Color Bedding for Bedroom Guest Room Dorm Lightweight Comfortable 200 x 150 cm (Vintage Milk Tea)","bullets":"COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: The duvet cover uses ice silk fabric that feels cool against the skin and helps create a more comfortable rest. Its smooth weave is breathable and gentle for everyday use.\n\nSILKY SMOOTH TOUCH: The silky smooth surface glides softly over the skin and creates a gentle, lightweight feel. It drapes neatly over your duvet and adds a subtle sheen to your bedroom.\n\nSOLID COLOR STYLE: The solid vintage milk tea tone offers a warm and understated look that blends with many bedroom settings, guest rooms, and dorm spaces.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (150 x 200cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nBREATHABLE AND LIGHTWEIGHT: The breathable fabric allows air to pass through, while the lightweight design makes it easy to layer over your bedding. It is simple to use and store when not needed.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C3/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C3/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C3/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C3/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C3/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C3/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c4": {"title":"Cooling Silk Touch Duvet Cover Breathable Silky Smooth Soft Lightweight Solid Color Bedding for Hot Sleepers Dorm Room and Guest Room 230 x 200 cm (Champagne Tea Green)","bullets":"COOLING SILK TOUCH FABRIC: The duvet cover features a cooling ice silk fabric with a silky smooth surface that feels fresh and gentle against the skin. Its breathable design helps reduce stuffiness for hot sleepers and supports a comfortable night of rest.\n\nBREATHABLE AND SMOOTH: The lightweight, silky texture allows air to flow through the fabric for a comfortable sleep experience. The smooth finish drapes neatly over your bedding and feels soft without a heavy weight.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (200 x 230cm), 1 fitted sheet (152 x 203 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nSOLID COLOR STYLING: The solid champagne tea green tone brings a calm, elegant look to dorm rooms, guest rooms, and main bedrooms. The minimal color style pairs easily with different bedroom decor.\n\nEASY CARE DESIGN: The duvet cover is lightweight and easy to maintain with simple care. Its soft surface and solid color finish make it a practical choice for regular bedroom refresh.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C4/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C4/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C4/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C4/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C4/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C4/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c5": {"title":"Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Breathable Smooth Solid Color Bedding Cover For Hot Sleepers Soft Lightweight Silky Touch Fabric 220 x 180 cm (Champagne Tea Green)","bullets":"COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: Made with cooling ice silk fabric that feels smooth and refreshing against the skin. The breathable weave helps air circulate for a comfortable sleep experience, ideal for hot sleepers and warm rooms.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (180 x 220cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nSMOOTH BREATHABLE FEEL: The silky surface glides over skin and helps reduce friction, while the lightweight fabric drapes softly for a relaxed rest.\n\nSOLID CHAMPAGNE TEA GREEN STYLE: The solid champagne tea green tone brings a calm and elegant look to the bedroom. It pairs easily with different sheet colors and decor styles for a clean, modern finish.\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT EASY CARE: The duvet cover is lightweight for easy layering, folding, and storage. Simple maintenance helps keep it ready for regular use.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C5/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C5/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C5/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C5/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C5/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C5/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c6": {"title":"Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Silky Breathable Solid Color Soft Smooth Lightweight Duvet Cover for Dormitory Hotel Guest Room 200 x 150 cm (Champagne Tea Green)","bullets":"COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: This duvet cover is made of cooling ice silk fabric that feels silky smooth against the skin. The breathable material promotes air circulation and helps wick away moisture, keeping you comfortable on warm nights.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (150 x 200cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nSILKY SMOOTH & SKIN-FRIENDLY: The ice silk fabric offers a gentle, smooth touch that is kind to your skin. Its lightweight and soft texture allows for a relaxing sleep experience without feeling heavy or clingy.\n\nVERSATILE SOLID COLOR DESIGN: The solid champagne tea green color brings a clean and elegant look to your bedroom. This neutral tone easily matches various decor styles, making it suitable for dormitories, guest rooms, and master bedrooms.\n\nEASY CARE & DURABLE: The duvet cover is easy to maintain and can be machine washed on a gentle cycle. The fabric retains its softness and color after repeated use, providing long-lasting comfort.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C6/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C6/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C6/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C6/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C6/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C6/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c7": {"title":"Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover 200 x 230 cm Silky Breathable Soft Solid Color Bedding Set for Hot Sleepers Dorm Room and Warm Nights Comfort (Beige Dark Grey)","bullets":"WHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (200 x 230cm), 1 fitted sheet (152 x 203 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nCOOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: The ice silk material feels noticeably cool and refreshing the moment it touches your skin, helping you stay comfortable through warm nights. Its smooth surface glides over the body instead of clinging, so you can settle in without constantly rearranging your bedding.\n\nSILKY SMOOTH AND BREATHABLE: A tightly woven yet airy construction delivers a fluid, silky hand feel while allowing air to circulate through the fabric. This helps reduce the stuffy heat that builds up under ordinary covers, keeping your sleeping space feeling fresh and light.\n\nREVERSIBLE TWO TONE LOOK: One side shows a warm beige tone and the other a calm dark grey, making it easy to flip the cover for a different mood or layer it with contrasting pillows. The clean solid color styling fits modern, minimalist and dorm style bedrooms alike.\n\nEASY CARE AND LONG LASTING: Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle with similar colors, then tumble dry low. The fabric resists wrinkling and keeps its smooth, fluid drape after washing, so it looks neat on the bed without extra ironing or special treatment.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C7/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C7/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C7/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C7/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C7/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C7/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c8": {"title":"Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Silky Breathable Solid Color Bedding Set for Dorm Bedroom Soft Smooth Lightweight Summer Comfort Machine Washable 180 x 220 cm (Beige Dark Grey)","bullets":"COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: Crafted from ice silk material with a naturally cool, silky hand feel that helps you stay comfortable on warm nights. The smooth surface glides over the skin, reducing that sticky feeling so you can settle in and rest without tossing and turning.\n\nSILKY SMOOTH AND BREATHABLE: The tightly woven ice silk weave feels sleek and soft against the skin while allowing air to move through the fabric. Lightweight and gentle, it drapes neatly over the bed and works well for warm seasons, air conditioned rooms, and year round use for sleepers who prefer a cooler touch.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (180 x 220cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nTWO TONE SOLID COLOR DESIGN: Reversible beige and dark grey panels create a clean, modern look that pairs easily with wood, white, or neutral bedroom furniture. Flip the duvet cover to switch the mood of the room, mixing a warm milky camel tone on one side with a calm deep grey on the other.\n\nEASY CARE AND EVERYDAY USE: Machine washable on a gentle cycle and quick to line dry, so refreshing the bed between laundry days takes little effort. The fabric resists wrinkling and holds its smooth finish, making it a practical choice for dorm rooms, guest bedrooms, rentals, and everyday home bedding.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C8/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C8/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C8/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C8/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C8/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C8/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c9": {"title":"Cooling Silky Duvet Cover Breathable Smooth Bedding Cover Soft Skin Friendly Cozy Lightweight Comforter Protector For Bedroom Guest Room 200 x 150 cm (Camel Dark Grey)","bullets":"COOLING SILKY FEEL: The duvet cover uses a silky cooling fabric that feels smooth and refreshing against the skin. Its lightweight drape helps reduce the heavy, clingy feel of ordinary covers for a more comfortable rest.\n\nBREATHABLE COMFORT: The breathable weave promotes airflow and helps manage moisture, so the cover feels airy and comfortable. The soft surface glides over bedding and works well for layering with your favorite comforter insert.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (150 x 200cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nTWO TONE SOLID STYLE: The camel and dark grey color combination offers a clean, modern look that pairs easily with different bedroom themes. The solid tones create a calm, uncluttered feel and can be styled with pillows, throws, or other bedding you already own.\n\nVERSATILE BEDROOM USE: The simple solid design works for a primary bedroom, guest room, or dorm room. The smooth fabric and neutral color palette make it easy to refresh your bed layout without changing the whole room.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C9/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C9/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C9/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C9/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C9/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C9/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c10": {"title":"Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Silky Breathable Solid Color Bedding Protector Soft Smooth Comforter Cover For Bedroom Guest Room Lightweight 230 x 200 cm (Milk Tea)","bullets":"COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: This duvet cover is crafted from cooling ice silk fabric that delivers a silky smooth and breathable feel, helping you stay comfortable during warm nights.\n\nSILKY SMOOTH TEXTURE: The ice silk material offers a gentle, skin-friendly touch that reduces friction and feels soft against your skin for a restful sleep experience.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (200 x 230cm), 1 fitted sheet (152 x 203 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nSOLID COLOR DESIGN: The solid color design complements various bedroom styles, making it easy to mix and match with your existing bedding and decor for a clean, modern look.\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT & EASY CARE: This duvet cover is lightweight and easy to fold and store, and it can be machine washed on a gentle cycle for convenient care and long-lasting use.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C10/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C10/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C10/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C10/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C10/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C10/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c11": {"title":"Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Silky Breathable Solid Color Bedding Duvet Cover Soft Smooth Lightweight Comforter Cover for Bedroom Guest Room 180 x 220 cm (Beige)","bullets":"WHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (180 x 220cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nCOOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: The duvet cover is made of cooling ice silk fabric that provides a refreshing and silky feel, helping you stay comfortable during warm nights.\n\nCOMPONENT BREAKDOWN: This listing includes 1 x Duvet Cover, measuring 220 x 180cm, so you receive one duvet cover in the specified size.\n\nSOLID COLOR WITH CONTRAST TRIM: The solid color design features a subtle contrast trim, adding a modern and elegant look to your bedroom or guest room.\n\nSOFT BREATHABLE AND LIGHTWEIGHT: The soft, breathable, and lightweight material drapes smoothly and feels gentle against the skin for a restful sleep experience.\n\nVERSATILE BEDROOM ESSENTIAL: The duvet cover is a versatile bedding essential that pairs easily with different sheet sets and pillowcases for a coordinated bedroom style.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C11/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C11/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C11/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C11/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C11/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C11/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c12": {"title":"Luxury Soft Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover, Silky Breathable Solid Color Bedding Cover, Smooth Lightweight Comforter Protector for Bedroom Guest Room, 200 x 230 cm (Cream)","bullets":"WHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (200 x 230cm), 1 fitted sheet (152 x 203 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nCOOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: Made with cooling ice silk fabric, this duvet cover feels cool to the touch and helps create a comfortable sleep environment for hot sleepers. The smooth surface feels gentle against the skin.\n\nSILKY SMOOTH AND BREATHABLE: The silky breathable texture allows air to circulate and helps reduce moisture buildup, keeping you comfortable through the night. Its soft drape adds a subtle sheen that elevates your bedding.\n\nSOLID COLOR EASY MATCHING: The solid color design offers a versatile, minimalist look that pairs easily with different bedroom styles. The understated tone brings a calm, cozy atmosphere to your space.\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT COMFORTER PROTECTOR: This lightweight duvet cover protects your comforter from daily dust and wear while remaining easy to handle. It is simple to remove and put back on, making bedding refresh quick and convenient.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C12/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C12/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C12/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C12/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C12/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C12/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c13": {"title":"Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Breathable Silky Smooth Solid Color Cooling Bedding For Dormitory Room Soft Lightweight Cozy Comforter Cover With Cooling Touch 180 x 220 cm (Cream)","bullets":"COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: Crafted from cooling ice silk fabric, this duvet cover offers a refreshing, silky-smooth feel that helps reduce sticky heat and keeps you comfortable through the night. The breathable weave promotes airflow for a cool, cozy sleep experience.\n\nSILKY SMOOTH AND SKIN-FRIENDLY: The soft, delicate texture glides over the skin and feels gentle on sensitive sleepers. Its smooth surface minimizes friction against hair and skin, making bedtime more relaxing and comfortable.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (180 x 220cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nSOLID COLOR MODERN STYLE: The solid cream tone brings a clean, minimalist look to dormitory rooms, bedrooms, and guest rooms. It pairs easily with a variety of bedding and decor styles, adding a calm and elegant touch to your space.\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT AND EASY TO STYLE: This lightweight duvet cover is easy to layer with blankets or use on its own for a smooth, streamlined bed. It is simple to fold, store, and refresh, making it a practical choice for everyday bedroom use.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C13/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C13/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C13/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C13/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C13/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C13/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c14": {"title":"Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Silky Breathable Solid Color Bedding Cover Smooth Lightweight Soft Machine Washable Comforter Cover for Bedroom Dorm Hotel 200 x 150 cm (Beige)","bullets":"COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: This duvet cover is crafted from cooling ice silk fabric that feels smooth and refreshing against the skin. The breathable weave helps air circulate, creating a comfortable sleep environment without a heavy or clingy feel.\n\nSILKY SMOOTH AND BREATHABLE: The silky surface glides over the skin and helps reduce friction for a restful night. Its lightweight, breathable construction makes it a comfortable choice for bedrooms, guest rooms, and dorm rooms.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (150 x 200cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT AND EASY TO STYLE: The soft, lightweight duvet cover drapes smoothly and is easy to layer with your existing bedding. Its solid color design adds a clean, modern look that complements many bedroom styles.\n\nEASY CARE AND VERSATILE USE: Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle and tumble dry low for simple maintenance. The duvet cover is suitable for bedrooms, guest rooms, dorms, and hotel-style bedding setups.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C14/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C14/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C14/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C14/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C14/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C14/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c15": {"title":"1 Piece Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Silky Breathable Solid Color Bedding Cover For Bedroom Dorm Guest Room Soft Smooth Lightweight 230 x 200 cm (Peach Pink White)","bullets":"Cooling Ice Silk Fabric: Made with ice silk material, this duvet cover offers a smooth, silky surface that feels cool and refreshing against the skin while remaining breathable for restful sleep.\n\nSilky Breathable Comfort: The lightweight ice silk weave drapes softly over your comforter and allows air to flow, helping reduce stuffiness and sticky heat for a more comfortable night.\n\nSolid Color Home Decor: The peach pink and white solid color design brings a clean, elegant look to bedrooms, dorms, and guest rooms, and coordinates easily with a wide range of sheet and pillow colors.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (200 x 230cm), 1 fitted sheet (152 x 203 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nVersatile Bedding Layer: Designed as a single duvet cover, it works well for bedroom, dorm, or guest room setups and can be layered with a comforter, quilt, or blanket to suit your sleep preference.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C15/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C15/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C15/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C15/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C15/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C15/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,true]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c16": {"title":"Luxury Ice Silk Duvet Cover Cooling Silky Breathable Solid Color Bedding for Hot Sleepers Dorm Room Lightweight Soft Smooth Comforter Protector 220 x 180 cm (Peach Pink White)","bullets":"Cooling Ice Silk Fabric: Crafted from cooling ice silk fabric, this duvet cover helps create a refreshing sleep environment for hot sleepers. The smooth surface feels cool to the touch and brings a gentle, breathable feel to your bed.\n\nSilky Smooth and Breathable: The silky breathable weave allows air to flow through, while the soft finish glides over the skin. It drapes neatly over your comforter and adds a smooth, comfortable touch.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (180 x 220cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nSolid Color Elegant Look: The peach pink and white palette offers a soft, clean look that fits dorm rooms, guest rooms, and modern bedrooms. The solid color design pairs easily with different bedding for a calm, coordinated bed.\n\nLightweight and Easy to Store: The lightweight design folds compactly for simple storage and quick bedding changes. It is a practical choice for everyday use and makes a thoughtful addition to your sleep space.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C16/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C16/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C16/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C16/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C16/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C16/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,true]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c17": {"title":"Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Smooth Breathable Silky Solid Color Soft Skin Friendly Lightweight Comfy Washable Quilt Cover for Bedroom 200 x 150 cm (Peach Pink White)","bullets":"COOLING ICE SILK TOUCH: The fabric surface feels noticeably cool and silky the moment it meets your skin, helping you stay comfortable through warm, stuffy nights and wake up feeling refreshed instead of overheated.\n\nSMOOTH AND BREATHABLE: A lightweight weave lets air move freely through the cover, while the fine silky texture glides gently over the body for a soft, skin friendly feel that stays pleasant all night long.\n\nREFRESHING PEACH PINK AND WHITE: The soft peach pink tone balanced with clean white creates a calm, elegant look that brightens the bedroom and blends easily with light wood, white, or pastel decor styles.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (150 x 200cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nEASY CARE AND LASTING SOFTNESS: Machine washable on a gentle cycle for simple everyday upkeep, and the fabric keeps its silky hand feel and fresh color when washed and dried with regular care.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C17/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C17/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C17/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C17/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C17/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C17/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,true]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c18": {"title":"Premium Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Soft Silky Breathable Solid Color Bedding Cover For Bedroom Dorm Home Use Skin Friendly Machine Washable 230 x 200 cm (Light Blue)","bullets":"WHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (200 x 230cm), 1 fitted sheet (152 x 203 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nCOOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: The duvet cover is made of cooling ice silk fabric that feels cool to the touch, smooth, and breathable. Its lightweight structure helps support airflow for a more comfortable sleep environment.\n\nSILKY SMOOTH TOUCH: The silky surface glides gently over the skin and feels soft against the body. Breathable fibers help reduce stuffiness, making it a comfortable choice for nightly rest.\n\nSOLID COLOR STYLE: The solid light blue design offers a clean, calm look that complements bedrooms, guest rooms, and dorm spaces. It pairs easily with different pillowcases, blankets, and decor styles.\n\nEASY CARE: Machine washable for convenient upkeep. Wash with similar colors on a gentle cycle, then tumble dry low or line dry to help maintain the smooth finish.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C18/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C18/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C18/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C18/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C18/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C18/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c19": {"title":"Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Silky Breathable Quilt Cover Solid Color Bedding for Hot Sleepers Soft Smooth Skin-Friendly Comforter Cover 220 x 180 cm (Light Blue)","bullets":"COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: This duvet cover is crafted from ice silk fabric that delivers a refreshing cooling touch, helping you stay comfortable and relaxed when you sleep hot.\n\nSILKY SMOOTH & BREATHABLE: The silky surface glides softly over your skin while the breathable construction promotes airflow, creating a smooth and airy sleep experience.\n\nSOLID COLOR & MODERN LOOK: The solid light blue tone adds a clean, elegant accent to your bedroom, and it pairs easily with different sheets, pillows, and room decor.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (180 x 220cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nEASY CARE & VERSATILE USE: This duvet cover is simple to maintain and works well in dorm rooms, guest rooms, and master bedrooms, offering a soft and comfortable layer for everyday use.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C19/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C19/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C19/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C19/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C19/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C19/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c20": {"title":"Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Breathable Silky Smooth Lightweight Solid Color Bed Cover For Hot Sleepers Comfortable And Cozy 230 x 200 cm (Peach Purple)","bullets":"WHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (200 x 230cm), 1 fitted sheet (152 x 203 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nCooling Ice Silk Fabric: Crafted from ice silk, this duvet cover offers a refreshing cool-to-the-touch feel that helps you stay comfortable.\n\nSilky Smooth and Breathable: The smooth, silky surface glides over your skin, while the breathable weave promotes airflow to reduce overheating.\n\nLightweight and Comfortable: Designed to be lightweight and gentle, this duvet cover is ideal for hot sleepers who want a cozy yet airy layer.\n\nElegant Solid Color Design: The solid peach purple hue adds a subtle, modern look to your bedroom and mixes easily with other bedding and decor.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C20/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C20/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C20/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C20/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C20/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C20/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c21": {"title":"Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Solid Color Silky Breathable Bedding For Dormitory Bedroom Hot Sleepers Soft Smooth Skin Friendly Comfortable 220 x 180 cm (White Peach Taro Purple)","bullets":"WHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (180 x 220cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nCOOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: The cooling ice silk fabric offers a refreshing touch, helping to reduce the feeling of heat and stickiness during warm nights. Silky and smooth, it glides over the skin for a comfortable sleep.\n\nBREATHABLE AND SILKY SMOOTH: Breathable construction allows air to flow, while the silky surface feels soft and gentle. Lightweight and smooth, it is suitable for hot sleepers and warm climates.\n\nSOLID COLOR DESIGN: The solid color design in White Peach Taro Purple creates a clean, modern aesthetic. This versatile style pairs easily with various bedroom decors and bedding sets.\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT AND EASY TO USE: Lightweight and foldable, this duvet cover is simple to store and handle. Suitable for dormitories, bedrooms, guest rooms, and travel, it is a practical bedding choice.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C21/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C21/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C21/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C21/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C21/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C21/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572-c22": {"title":"Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Breathable Silky Smooth Solid Color Bedding for Hot Sleepers Soft Gentle Lightweight Cozy Duvet Cover 150 x 200 cm (White Peach Purple)","bullets":"COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: Made with cooling ice silk fabric, this duvet cover offers a refreshing, silky touch that helps reduce the feeling of stuffiness for hot sleepers. The smooth surface glides against the skin and creates a comfortable sleep environment without heavy weight.\n\nSILKY SMOOTH AND BREATHABLE: The breathable weave allows air to circulate, while the silky smooth texture feels gentle and soft against the skin. It is designed to provide a light, airy feel that helps you stay comfortable through the night.\n\nSIMPLE SOLID COLOR DESIGN: The solid color finish in soft white peach purple tones brings a clean, modern look to bedrooms, dorms, guest rooms, and more. Its understated style pairs easily with different sheet sets and room decor.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (150 x 200cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT AND EASY CARE: The lightweight construction makes this duvet cover easy to fold and store when not in use. For care, simply follow the care label and wash as needed to keep it clean and ready for use.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C22/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C22/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C22/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C22/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C22/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572-C22/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1048207560416-c2": {"title":"Cooling Washed Ice Silk Dual-Tone Quilt Cover Soft Breathable Skin-Friendly Lightweight Smooth Bedding For Comfortable Sleep And Cozy Bedroom Decor 150 x 200 cm (Cream Green)","bullets":"Cooling Ice Silk Comfort: The quilt cover is made with washed ice silk fabric that feels smooth and cool to the touch. Its lightweight, breathable construction helps reduce stuffiness and supports a comfortable sleep environment. The soft surface is gentle on skin and suitable for relaxing rest.\n\nDual-Tone Reversible Style: The dual-tone design pairs a soft green side with a creamy side, so you can switch the look to match your bedroom decor. The elegant color combination adds a calm, modern touch to your bedding and works well with many interior styles.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (150 x 200cm), 1 fitted sheet (99 x 191 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nSoft Washed Texture: The washed finish gives the fabric a soft, flexible hand feel that drapes neatly over the bed. The smooth surface minimizes friction and feels comfortable against skin. It is a thoughtful choice for those who prefer lightweight bedding with a silky touch.\n\nEasy Care and Everyday Use: The quilt cover can be washed as needed and is simple to maintain for regular use. Its lightweight design makes it easy to fold, store, and refresh. Use it as a standalone cover or coordinate it with other bedding pieces for a clean, layered look.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1048207560416-C2/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1048207560416-C2/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1048207560416-C2/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1048207560416-C2/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1048207560416-C2/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1048207560416-C2/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-1061371343572": {"title":"Luxurious Silky Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Breathable Smooth Solid Color Bedding For Dormitory Use Lightweight Soft Cozy 230 x 200 cm (Vintage Milk Tea)","bullets":"WHAT'S INCLUDED: This 4-piece bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (200 x 230cm), 1 fitted sheet (152 x 203 cm), and 2 matching pillowcases — a coordinated look right out of the package. Duvet insert is not included.\n\nSILKY ICE SILK COOLING FABRIC: Made from smooth ice silk material, this duvet cover has a cool-to-the-touch surface and a sleek, silky hand feel. The fabric is lightweight and breathable, helping create a comfortable sleep setting for warm rooms and restful nights.\n\nSMOOTH BREATHABLE COMFORT: The breathable weave allows air to move through the fabric, while the soft drape adds a gentle, cozy layer over your duvet. It feels smooth against the skin and is suitable for those who prefer lightweight bedding.\n\nMINIMAL SOLID COLOR DESIGN: The Vintage Milk Tea shade offers a warm neutral tone that complements modern, minimalist, and vintage-style bedrooms. The solid color look creates a clean, calm atmosphere and pairs easily with other bedding accessories.\n\nCOMPONENT AND SIZE: Package includes 1 x Duvet Cover: 230 x 200cm. The duvet insert or comforter is not included. Please check the measurements before ordering to ensure the right fit for your duvet.\n\nEASY CARE AND VERSATILE USE: Designed for regular bedroom use, this duvet cover works well in dormitories, apartments, guest rooms, and master bedrooms. Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle and tumble dry low for simple care; do not bleach.","sku":"","images":["/images/products/1688-1061371343572/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1061371343572/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,true,false]},
  "1688-913882303732": {"title":"Memory Foam U Shaped Neck Pillow for Travel, Airplane, Office Nap, Adjustable Cervical Support Pillow with Washable Cover, Reversible Design, Eggshell Storage Case, 23 x 23 x 12 cm (Violet)","bullets":"ERGONOMIC MEMORY FOAM SUPPORT: High-density slow-rebound memory foam cradles your neck and head to ease pressure on long trips and naps, with a reversible two-sided design for personalized comfort.\n\nADJUSTABLE SLIDING CORD FIT: Press the unlock buckle and slide to fine-tune tightness in seconds - one size comfortably fits different neck sizes without pinching or slipping.\n\nROLLS INTO AN EGGSHELL CASE: The pillow rolls up and zips into the included eggshell storage case (about 18 x 15 x 11 cm, 0.8 lb) with a carry strap that clips to your backpack or luggage.\n\nREMOVABLE, WASHABLE COVER: Skin-friendly breathable knit cover with a hidden zipper removes in seconds - machine wash cold (30 C) and hang dry; memory foam core is spot-clean only.\n\nTRAVEL-READY EVERYWHERE: Lightweight 250 g (8.8 oz) U-shaped pillow for airplanes, trains, cars, office desks and home reading - a practical gift for commuters and frequent flyers.","sku":"US-JWUYON","images":["/images/products/1688-913882303732/1.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732/2.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732/3.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732/4.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732/5.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,false]},
  "1688-913882303732-c3": {"title":"Lightweight Memory Foam Neck Pillow for Airplane Travel, Reversible U Shaped Cervical Support Pillow with Adjustable Drawstring and Washable Cover, 23 x 23 x 12 cm (Green)","bullets":"ERGONOMIC MEMORY FOAM SUPPORT: High-density slow-rebound memory foam cradles your neck and head to ease pressure on long trips and naps, with a reversible two-sided design for personalized comfort.\n\nADJUSTABLE SLIDING CORD FIT: Press the unlock buckle and slide to fine-tune tightness in seconds - one size comfortably fits different neck sizes without pinching or slipping.\n\nROLLS INTO AN EGG-SHAPED CASE: The pillow rolls up and zips into the included compact egg-shaped storage case (about 16 x 16 x 14 cm, 0.95 lb) with a carry strap that clips to your backpack or luggage.\n\nREMOVABLE, WASHABLE COVER: Skin-friendly breathable knit cover with a hidden zipper removes in seconds - machine wash cold (30 C) and hang dry; memory foam core is spot-clean only.\n\nTRAVEL-READY EVERYWHERE: Lightweight 250 g (8.8 oz) U-shaped pillow for airplanes, trains, cars, office desks and home reading - a practical gift for commuters and frequent flyers.","sku":"US-PHTBFY","images":["/images/products/1688-913882303732-c3/1.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c3/2.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c3/3.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c3/4.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c3/5.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c3/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,false]},
  "1688-913882303732-c4": {"title":"Memory Foam Travel Neck Pillow with Egg Shaped Storage Case Reversible Washable Cover Adjustable U Shaped Cervical Support Pillow for Airplane Nap 23 x 23 x 12 cm (Pink)","bullets":"ERGONOMIC MEMORY FOAM SUPPORT: High-density slow-rebound memory foam cradles your neck and head to ease pressure on long trips and naps, with a reversible two-sided design for personalized comfort.\n\nADJUSTABLE SLIDING CORD FIT: Press the unlock buckle and slide to fine-tune tightness in seconds - one size comfortably fits different neck sizes without pinching or slipping.\n\nROLLS INTO AN EGG-SHAPED CASE: The pillow rolls up and zips into the included compact egg-shaped storage case (about 16 x 16 x 14 cm, 0.95 lb) with a carry strap that clips to your backpack or luggage.\n\nREMOVABLE, WASHABLE COVER: Skin-friendly breathable knit cover with a hidden zipper removes in seconds - machine wash cold (30 C) and hang dry; memory foam core is spot-clean only.\n\nTRAVEL-READY EVERYWHERE: Lightweight 250 g (8.8 oz) U-shaped pillow for airplanes, trains, cars, office desks and home reading - a practical gift for commuters and frequent flyers.","sku":"US-QD9KZT","images":["/images/products/1688-913882303732-c4/1.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c4/2.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c4/3.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c4/4.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c4/5.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c4/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,false]},
  "1688-913882303732-c5": {"title":"Lightweight Memory Foam U-Shaped Neck Pillow for Travel Airplane Nap Cervical Support Reversible Adjustable Washable Cover with Egg Storage Case 23 x 23 x 12 cm (Obsidian Grey)","bullets":"ERGONOMIC MEMORY FOAM SUPPORT: High-density slow-rebound memory foam cradles your neck and head to ease pressure on long trips and naps, with a reversible two-sided design for personalized comfort.\n\nADJUSTABLE SLIDING CORD FIT: Press the unlock buckle and slide to fine-tune tightness in seconds - one size comfortably fits different neck sizes without pinching or slipping.\n\nROLLS INTO AN EGG-SHAPED CASE: The pillow rolls up and zips into the included compact egg-shaped storage case (about 16 x 16 x 14 cm, 0.95 lb) with a carry strap that clips to your backpack or luggage.\n\nREMOVABLE, WASHABLE COVER: Skin-friendly breathable knit cover with a hidden zipper removes in seconds - machine wash cold (30 C) and hang dry; memory foam core is spot-clean only.\n\nTRAVEL-READY EVERYWHERE: Lightweight 250 g (8.8 oz) U-shaped pillow for airplanes, trains, cars, office desks and home reading - a practical gift for commuters and frequent flyers.","sku":"US-Y315JC","images":["/images/products/1688-913882303732-c5/1.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c5/2.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c5/3.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c5/4.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c5/5.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c5/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,false]},
  "1688-913882303732-c6": {"title":"Memory Foam U-Shaped Travel Neck Pillow with Egg Storage Case, Portable Adjustable Cervical Support for Airplane Nap Sleeping and Rest, 23 x 23 x 12 cm (Ivory White)","bullets":"ERGONOMIC MEMORY FOAM SUPPORT: High-density slow-rebound memory foam cradles your neck and head to ease pressure on long trips and naps, with a reversible two-sided design for personalized comfort.\n\nADJUSTABLE SLIDING CORD FIT: Press the unlock buckle and slide to fine-tune tightness in seconds - one size comfortably fits different neck sizes without pinching or slipping.\n\nROLLS INTO AN EGG-SHAPED CASE: The pillow rolls up and zips into the included compact egg-shaped storage case (about 16 x 16 x 14 cm, 0.95 lb) with a carry strap that clips to your backpack or luggage.\n\nREMOVABLE, WASHABLE COVER: Skin-friendly breathable knit cover with a hidden zipper removes in seconds - machine wash cold (30 C) and hang dry; memory foam core is spot-clean only.\n\nTRAVEL-READY EVERYWHERE: Lightweight 250 g (8.8 oz) U-shaped pillow for airplanes, trains, cars, office desks and home reading - a practical gift for commuters and frequent flyers.","sku":"US-KSMLJC","images":["/images/products/1688-913882303732-c6/1.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c6/2.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c6/3.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c6/4.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c6/5.webp", "/images/products/1688-913882303732-c6/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,false]},
  "duvset-pink-duvet": {"title":"Soft Washed Cotton-Like Duvet Cover Breathable Lightweight Solid Color Bedding Cover With Zipper Closure For Bedroom Guest Room Easy Care (Pink)","bullets":"STANDALONE DUVET COVER: One duvet cover only, comforter not included. Slip it over your duvet to instantly refresh the bedroom.\n\nSOFT WASHED COTTON-LIKE FABRIC: Garment-washed for a naturally soft, breathable feel with a relaxed, slightly wrinkled texture that is gentle on skin and promotes airflow for year-round comfort.\n\nGENTLE BLUSH PINK STYLE: A soft, muted pink that adds quiet warmth, pairing well with white, cream, grey and gold accents, fitting cottage, shabby chic, boho and modern rooms.\n\nSECURE FIT DESIGN: Hidden zipper closure plus interior corner ties keep the duvet insert from shifting through the night.\n\nEASY CARE MACHINE WASHABLE: Machine wash cold, tumble dry low. The wrinkle-resistant washed finish keeps the cover looking fresh with minimal effort.","sku":"DUVSET-PINK-DUVET","images":["/images/products/DUVSET-PINK-DUVET/1.webp","/images/products/DUVSET-PINK-DUVET/2.webp","/images/products/DUVSET-PINK-DUVET/3.webp","/images/products/DUVSET-PINK-DUVET/4.webp","/images/products/DUVSET-PINK-DUVET/5.webp","/images/products/DUVSET-PINK-DUVET/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,true]},
  "duvset-beige-duvet": {"title":"Soft Washed Cotton-Like Duvet Cover Breathable Lightweight Solid Color Bedding Cover With Zipper Closure For Bedroom Guest Room Easy Care (Beige)","bullets":"STANDALONE DUVET COVER: One duvet cover only, comforter not included. Slip it over your duvet to instantly refresh the bedroom.\n\nSOFT WASHED COTTON-LIKE FABRIC: Garment-washed for a naturally soft, breathable feel with a relaxed, slightly wrinkled texture that is gentle on skin and promotes airflow for year-round comfort.\n\nWARM BEIGE STYLE: A cozy adaptable neutral that brightens the bed, pairing well with white, brown, terracotta and green, fitting farmhouse, rustic, boho and minimalist rooms.\n\nSECURE FIT DESIGN: Hidden zipper closure plus interior corner ties keep the duvet insert from shifting through the night.\n\nEASY CARE MACHINE WASHABLE: Machine wash cold, tumble dry low. The wrinkle-resistant washed finish keeps the cover looking fresh with minimal effort.","sku":"DUVSET-BEIGE-DUVET","images":["/images/products/DUVSET-BEIGE-DUVET/1.webp","/images/products/DUVSET-BEIGE-DUVET/2.webp","/images/products/DUVSET-BEIGE-DUVET/3.webp","/images/products/DUVSET-BEIGE-DUVET/4.webp","/images/products/DUVSET-BEIGE-DUVET/5.webp","/images/products/DUVSET-BEIGE-DUVET/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,true]},
  "duvset-white-duvet": {"title":"Soft Washed Cotton-Like Duvet Cover Breathable Lightweight Solid Color Bedding Cover With Zipper Closure For Bedroom Guest Room Easy Care (White)","bullets":"STANDALONE DUVET COVER: One duvet cover only, comforter not included. Slip it over your duvet to instantly refresh the bedroom.\n\nSOFT WASHED COTTON-LIKE FABRIC: Garment-washed for a naturally soft, breathable feel with a relaxed, slightly wrinkled texture that is gentle on skin and promotes airflow for year-round comfort.\n\nCRISP PURE WHITE STYLE: A clean airy white that suits any space, pairing well with every color palette and bedding layer, fitting modern, classic, coastal and minimalist rooms.\n\nSECURE FIT DESIGN: Hidden zipper closure plus interior corner ties keep the duvet insert from shifting through the night.\n\nEASY CARE MACHINE WASHABLE: Machine wash cold, tumble dry low. The wrinkle-resistant washed finish keeps the cover looking fresh with minimal effort.","sku":"DUVSET-WHITE-DUVET","images":["/images/products/DUVSET-WHITE-DUVET/1.webp","/images/products/DUVSET-WHITE-DUVET/2.webp","/images/products/DUVSET-WHITE-DUVET/3.webp","/images/products/DUVSET-WHITE-DUVET/4.webp","/images/products/DUVSET-WHITE-DUVET/5.webp","/images/products/DUVSET-WHITE-DUVET/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,true]},
  "mk-bp-insert-1pc": {"title":"Makimoo Long Body Pillow Insert, Soft Breathable Polyester Fiber Fill Rectangular Cushion for Bed Sofa Couch, 137 x 51 cm (White)","bullets":"Full-Body Support: The extra-long 137 x 51 cm (54 x 20 in) pillow cradles your body for side sleeping, lounging, reading or pregnancy support.\n\nSoft Breathable Fill: Generously filled with plush polyester fiber that balances softness and support and fluffs back easily.\n\nSmooth Brushed Shell: A soft brushed microfiber shell in clean white that fits any body pillow cover.\n\nVersatile Comfort: Ideal for beds, daybeds and sofas — use it as a hug pillow, backrest or leg support.\n\nEasy Care: Machine washable on a gentle cycle; tumble dry low to restore loft.","sku":"US-66B80J","images":["/images/products/MK-BP-INSERT-1PC/1.webp","/images/products/MK-BP-INSERT-1PC/2.webp","/images/products/MK-BP-INSERT-1PC/3.webp","/images/products/MK-BP-INSERT-1PC/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false]},
  "duvset-butter-twin": {"title":"Makimoo Twin Duvet Cover Set 4 Piece Soft Washed Cotton Breathable Lightweight All Season Wrinkle Resistant Bedding with Zipper Closure Corner Ties 68 x 88 in (Butter Yellow)","bullets":"Luxuriously Soft Fabric: Crafted from premium washed cotton fabric that feels gentle against skin, this breathable duvet cover set offers a cozy, lightweight sleep surface suitable for year-round comfort.\n\nSecure Zipper Closure & Corner Ties: The hidden zipper design keeps your comforter neatly tucked in, while interior corner ties help prevent shifting and bunching for a smooth, tidy bed every night.\n\nComplete Twin 4-Piece Set: This bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (68 x 88 in), 1 fitted sheet (39 x 75 in), and 2 pillowcases (20 x 26 in), providing a coordinated, hotel-inspired look for your bedroom.\n\nWrinkle Resistant & Easy Care: The durable fabric resists wrinkles and fading, machine washes easily, and dries quickly, saving you time while maintaining a fresh, inviting appearance.\n\nWarm Healing Tone: The muted Butter Yellow shade brings a calm, cozy feel to the bedroom and blends effortlessly with modern, classic, or neutral décor.","sku":"duvset-butter-twin","images":["/images/products/DUVSET-BUTTER-TWIN/1.webp"],"whiteBg":[false]},
  "duvset-butter-full": {"title":"Makimoo Full Duvet Cover Set 4 Piece Soft Washed Cotton Breathable Lightweight All Season Wrinkle Resistant Bedding with Zipper Closure Corner Ties 80 x 88 in (Butter Yellow)","bullets":"Luxuriously Soft Fabric: Crafted from premium washed cotton fabric that feels gentle against skin, this breathable duvet cover set offers a cozy, lightweight sleep surface suitable for year-round comfort.\n\nSecure Zipper Closure & Corner Ties: The hidden zipper design keeps your comforter neatly tucked in, while interior corner ties help prevent shifting and bunching for a smooth, tidy bed every night.\n\nComplete Full 4-Piece Set: This bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (80 x 88 in), 1 fitted sheet (54 x 75 in), and 2 pillowcases (20 x 26 in), providing a coordinated, hotel-inspired look for your bedroom.\n\nWrinkle Resistant & Easy Care: The durable fabric resists wrinkles and fading, machine washes easily, and dries quickly, saving you time while maintaining a fresh, inviting appearance.\n\nWarm Healing Tone: The muted Butter Yellow shade brings a calm, cozy feel to the bedroom and blends effortlessly with modern, classic, or neutral décor.","sku":"duvset-butter-full","images":["/images/products/DUVSET-BUTTER-FULL/1.webp"],"whiteBg":[false]},
