  "duvset-oat-king": {"title":"Makimoo King Duvet Cover Set 4 Piece Soft Washed Cotton Breathable Lightweight All Season Wrinkle Resistant Bedding with Zipper Closure Corner Ties 104 x 90 in (Alpine Oat)","bullets":"Luxuriously Soft Fabric: Crafted from premium washed cotton fabric that feels gentle against skin, this breathable duvet cover set offers a cozy, lightweight sleep surface suitable for year-round comfort.\n\nSecure Zipper Closure & Corner Ties: The hidden zipper design keeps your comforter neatly tucked in, while interior corner ties help prevent shifting and bunching for a smooth, tidy bed every night.\n\nComplete King 4-Piece Set: This bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (104 x 90 in), 1 fitted sheet (78 x 80 in), and 2 pillowcases (20 x 36 in), providing a coordinated, hotel-inspired look for your bedroom.\n\nWrinkle Resistant & Easy Care: The durable fabric resists wrinkles and fading, machine washes easily, and dries quickly, saving you time while maintaining a fresh, inviting appearance.\n\nWarm Healing Tone: The muted Alpine Oat shade brings a calm, cozy feel to the bedroom and blends effortlessly with modern, classic, or neutral décor.","sku":"duvset-oat-king","images":["/images/products/DUVSET-OAT-KING/1.webp"],"whiteBg":[false]},
  "percalejac-haze-duvet": {"title":"Makimoo 100% Cotton Percale Jacquard Wide Stripe Duvet Cover Only 88 x 88 in with Hidden Zipper and Corner Ties (Dusty Blue, Queen)","bullets":"100% Cotton Percale with Yarn-Dyed Jacquard: Woven in a crisp, tightly woven cotton percale, the duvet cover features yarn-dyed jacquard wide stripes with a subtle waffle texture. Reversible AB design—the A side shows the woven stripe jacquard, while the B side is a clean solid color.\n\nStandalone Duvet Cover, Queen Size: One duvet cover only (88 x 88 in). Pillowcases, fitted sheet and comforter are NOT included—slip it over your duvet to instantly refresh the bedroom.\n\nBreathable & Skin-Friendly All Season: The percale plain weave feels cool, smooth and gentle against the skin, with airy breathability that keeps you comfortable through warm summers and layered cozy in cooler months.\n\nThoughtful Details & Easy Care: A hidden zipper closure and interior corner ties keep your comforter neatly in place; the cover is machine washable and keeps its crisp hand and woven texture wash after wash.\n\nSoothing Dusty Blue Colorway: Finished in a hazy, muted Dusty Blue wide stripe with a soft grey undertone—calm and airy, it brings a quiet, restful feel to the bedroom, pairing easily with modern, classic, or cozy décor.","sku":"PERCALEJAC-HAZE-DUVET","images":["/images/products/PERCALEJAC-HAZE-DUVET/1.webp","/images/products/PERCALEJAC-HAZE-DUVET/2.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false]},  "percale-coconut-duvet": {"title":"Makimoo 100% Cotton Percale Duvet Cover Only Crisp Cool Breathable 88 x 88 in with Zipper Closure Corner Ties (Coconut Milk, Queen)","bullets":"Crisp 100% Cotton Percale: Woven in a tight plain weave, this duvet cover has the signature percale hand—matte, cool to the touch, and lightly structured—delivering that fresh, hotel-crisp feel that gets softer with every wash.\n\nStandalone Duvet Cover, Queen Size: One duvet cover only (88 x 88 in). Pillowcases, fitted sheet and comforter are NOT included—slip it over your duvet to instantly refresh the bedroom.\n\nSecure Zipper Closure & Corner Ties: The hidden zipper design keeps your comforter neatly tucked in, while interior corner ties help prevent shifting and bunching for a smooth, tidy bed every night.\n\nBreathable & Easy Care: The airy percale weave stays cool and comfortable year-round, machine washes easily, and is made to last—natural creases relax after a quick tumble or line dry.\n\nMuted Healing Tone: The soft Coconut Milk shade brings a calm, cozy feel to the bedroom and blends effortlessly with modern, classic, or neutral décor.","sku":"PERCALE-COCONUT-DUVET","images":["/images/products/PERCALE-COCONUT-DUVET/1.webp","/images/products/PERCALE-COCONUT-DUVET/2.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false]},
  "sateen4-olive-duvet": {"title":"Makimoo 100% Cotton Sateen Duvet Cover Only Silky Soft 88 x 88 in with Zipper Closure Corner Ties (Olive Green, Queen)","bullets":"Silky 100% Cotton Sateen: Woven in a fine sateen weave, this duvet cover has a smooth, lustrous surface with a subtle sheen—buttery-soft against the skin, with an elegant drape that brings quiet, hotel-level luxury to the bedroom.\n\nStandalone Duvet Cover, Queen Size: One duvet cover only (88 x 88 in). Pillowcases, fitted sheet and comforter are NOT included—slip it over your duvet to instantly refresh the bedroom.\n\nSecure Zipper Closure & Corner Ties: The hidden zipper design keeps your comforter neatly tucked in, while interior corner ties help prevent shifting and bunching for a smooth, tidy bed every night.\n\nGentle Sheen & Easy Care: The breathable sateen weave stays silky and comfortable year-round, machine washes easily, and gets softer with every wash while keeping its subtle luster.\n\nMuted Healing Tone: The soft Olive Green shade brings a calm, cozy feel to the bedroom and blends effortlessly with modern, classic, or neutral décor.","sku":"SATEEN4-OLIVE-DUVET","images":["/images/products/SATEEN4-OLIVE-DUVET/1.webp"],"whiteBg":[false]},
  "percalejac-oatbeige-duvet": {"title":"Makimoo 100% Cotton Percale Jacquard Wide Stripe Duvet Cover Only 88 x 88 in with Hidden Zipper and Corner Ties (Oatmeal Beige, Queen)","bullets":"100% Cotton Percale with Yarn-Dyed Jacquard: Woven in a crisp, tightly woven cotton percale, the duvet cover features yarn-dyed jacquard wide stripes with a subtle waffle texture. Reversible AB design—the A side shows the woven stripe jacquard, while the B side is a clean solid color.\n\nStandalone Duvet Cover, Queen Size: One duvet cover only (88 x 88 in). Pillowcases, fitted sheet and comforter are NOT included—slip it over your duvet to instantly refresh the bedroom.\n\nBreathable & Skin-Friendly All Season: The percale plain weave feels cool, smooth and gentle against the skin, with airy breathability that keeps you comfortable through warm summers and layered cozy in cooler months.\n\nThoughtful Details & Easy Care: A hidden zipper closure and interior corner ties keep your comforter neatly in place; the cover is machine washable and keeps its crisp hand and woven texture wash after wash.\n\nSoothing Oatmeal Beige Colorway: Finished in a warm, creamy Oatmeal Beige wide stripe—natural and cozy, it lends the room a soft, sunlit warmth, pairing easily with modern, classic, or cozy décor.","sku":"PERCALEJAC-OATBEIGE-DUVET","images":["/images/products/PERCALEJAC-OATBEIGE-DUVET/1.webp","/images/products/PERCALEJAC-OATBEIGE-DUVET/2.webp","/images/products/PERCALEJAC-OATBEIGE-DUVET/3.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false]},
  "washstripe-sage-duvet": {"title":"Makimoo Soft Washed Cotton Fine Stripe Duvet Cover Only 88 x 88 in with Hidden Zipper and Corner Ties (Sage Green, Queen)","bullets":"Soft Washed Cotton with Yarn-Dyed Stripe: Woven from garment-washed cotton-feel fabric with a broken-in softness from the very first night, the duvet cover features a yarn-dyed fine stripe woven into the cloth—not printed—so the color stays true wash after wash. Reversible AB design—the A side shows the fine stripe, while the B side is a clean solid color.\n\nStandalone Duvet Cover, Queen Size: One duvet cover only (88 x 88 in). Pillowcases, fitted sheet and comforter are NOT included—slip it over your duvet to instantly refresh the bedroom.\n\nBreathable & Skin-Friendly All Season: The washed plain weave feels soft, airy and gentle against the skin, keeping you comfortable through warm summers and layered cozy in cooler months.\n\nThoughtful Details & Easy Care: A hidden zipper closure and interior corner ties keep your comforter neatly in place; the cover is machine washable and gets even softer with every wash.\n\nSoothing Sage Green Colorway: Finished in a muted sage green and white fine stripe—low-saturation and naturally calming, it brings a quiet, botanical freshness to the bedroom, pairing easily with modern, classic, or cozy décor.","sku":"WASHSTRIPE-SAGE-DUVET","images":["/images/products/WASHSTRIPE-SAGE-DUVET/1.webp","/images/products/WASHSTRIPE-SAGE-DUVET/2.webp","/images/products/WASHSTRIPE-SAGE-DUVET/3.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false]},
